6.20561 4.41504 6.91665V13.0836Z"></path></svg>Virtual Herbal Garden Ui</button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="34e84f65-9abb-4489-a729-632688d3832c" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-t-mini"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="169">Done — I created a single-file React UI (Tailwind-based) called <strong data-start="64" data-end="94">"Virtual Herbal Garden UI"</strong> on the canvas. Open the canvas to view, run, or iterate on the component.</p>
<p data-start="171" data-end="194">If you want, I can now:</p>
<ul data-start="195" data-end="422" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">
<li data-start="195" data-end="268">
<p data-start="197" data-end="268">Add more plant entries (you can paste a CSV/list and I’ll import them).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="269" data-end="359">
<p data-start="271" data-end="359">Convert this into a multi-file project scaffold (React + Vite) with routes and mock API.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="360" data-end="422" data-is-last-node="">
<p data-start="362" data-end="422" data-is-last-node="">Add real AR/3D placeholders, audio guides, or a quiz engine.</p>
