ack interactive web project</strong>.<br data-start="110" data-end="113">
We’ll build it step-by-step, starting with the <strong data-start="160" data-end="187">frontend (React + Vite)</strong> and then connect a <strong data-start="207" data-end="248">backend (Node.js + Express + MongoDB)</strong> for plant data, user favorites, and quiz progress.</p>
<hr data-start="301" data-end="304">
<h2 data-start="306" data-end="328">🌱 Project Overview</h2>
<p data-start="330" data-end="502"><strong data-start="330" data-end="340">Title:</strong> Virtual Herbal Garden<br data-start="362" data-end="365">
<strong data-start="365" data-end="374">Goal:</strong> Interactive educational platform showcasing AYUSH medicinal plants (Ayurveda, Yoga &amp; Naturopathy, Unani, Siddha, Homeopathy).</p>
<hr data-start="504" data-end="507">
<h2 data-start="509" data-end="525">🧩 Tech Stack</h2>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="527" data-end="1042" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="527" data-end="558"><tr data-start="527" data-end="558"><th data-start="527" data-end="535" data-col-size="sm">Layer</th><th data-start="535" data-end="547" data-col-size="md">Tech Used</th><th data-start="547" data-end="558" data-col-size="sm">Purpose</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="593" data-end="1042"><tr data-start="593" data-end="659"><td data-start="593" data-end="608" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="595" data-end="607">Frontend</strong></td><td data-start="608" data-end="637" data-col-size="md">React + Vite + TailwindCSS</td><td data-start="637" data-end="659" data-col-size="sm">UI &amp; Interactivity</td></tr><tr data-start="660" data-end="740"><td data-start="660" data-end="683" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="662" data-end="682">State Management</strong></td><td data-start="683" data-end="711" data-col-size="md">React Context API / Redux</td><td data-start="711" data-end="740" data-col-size="sm">Manage favorites, filters</td></tr><tr data-start="741" data-end="814"><td data-start="741" data-end="755" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="743" data-end="754">Backend</strong></td><td data-start="755" data-end="775" data-col-size="md">Node.js + Express</td><td data-start="775" data-end="814" data-col-size="sm">REST API for plants, quizzes, users</td></tr><tr data-start="815" data-end="888"><td data-start="815" data-end="830" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="817" data-end="829">Database</strong></td><td data-start="830" data-end="857" data-col-size="md">MongoDB (Atlas or Local)</td><td data-start="857" data-end="888" data-col-size="sm">Store plant info, user data</td></tr><tr data-start="889" data-end="968"><td data-start="889" data-end="921" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="891" data-end="920">Authentication (optional)</strong></td><td data-start="921" data-end="938" data-col-size="md">JWT / Passport</td><td data-start="938" data-end="968" data-col-size="sm">For login &amp; saved progress</td></tr><tr data-start="969" data-end="1042"><td data-start="969" data-end="986" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="971" data-end="985">Deployment</strong></td><td data-start="986" data-end="1031" data-col-size="md">Vercel (frontend) + Render/Atlas (backend)</td><td data-start="1031" data-end="1042" data-col-size="sm">Hosting</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7969px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7797 4.91211 16.8027C5.29563 16.8341 5.78896 16.835 6.5 16.835H9.33301C10.0439 16.835 10.5374 16.8341 10.9209 16.8027C11.2965 16.772 11.508 16.7152 11.6