<hr data-start="1044" data-end="1047">
<h2 data-start="1049" data-end="1072">🧠 Frontend Features</h2>
<p data-start="1074" data-end="1321">✅ Search &amp; Filter medicinal plants<br data-start="1108" data-end="1111">
✅ View detailed info (uses, systems, images)<br data-start="1155" data-end="1158">
✅ Interactive components — 3D model, quiz, audio guide (placeholders now)<br data-start="1231" data-end="1234">
✅ User login + “My Garden” favorites page<br data-start="1275" data-end="1278">
✅ Learning Paths + AR / Guided Tour pages</p>
<hr data-start="1323" data-end="1326">
<h2 data-start="1328" data-end="1372">⚙️ Backend API Routes (Node.js + Express)</h2>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="1374" data-end="1823" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1374" data-end="1409"><tr data-start="1374" data-end="1409"><th data-start="1374" data-end="1383" data-col-size="sm">Method</th><th data-start="1383" data-end="1394" data-col-size="sm">Endpoint</th><th data-start="1394" data-end="1409" data-col-size="sm">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1448" data-end="1823"><tr data-start="1448" data-end="1490"><td data-start="1448" data-end="1456" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1450" data-end="1455">GET</code></td><td data-start="1456" data-end="1472" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1458" data-end="1471">/api/plants</code></td><td data-start="1472" data-end="1490" data-col-size="sm">Get all plants</td></tr><tr data-start="1491" data-end="1547"><td data-start="1491" data-end="1499" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1493" data-end="1498">GET</code></td><td data-start="1499" data-end="1519" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1501" data-end="1518">/api/plants/:id</code></td><td data-start="1519" data-end="1547" data-col-size="sm">Get a single plant by ID</td></tr><tr data-start="1548" data-end="1602"><td data-start="1548" data-end="1557" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1550" data-end="1556">POST</code></td><td data-start="1557" data-end="1581" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1559" data-end="1580">/api/users/register</code></td><td data-start="1581" data-end="1602" data-col-size="sm">Register new user</td></tr><tr data-start="1603" data-end="1642"><td data-start="1603" data-end="1612" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1605" data-end="1611">POST</code></td><td data-start="1612" data-end="1633" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1614" data-end="1632">/api/users/login</code></td><td data-start="1633" data-end="1642" data-col-size="sm">Login</td></tr><tr data-start="1643" data-end="1704"><td data-start="1643" data-end="1651" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1645" data-end="1650">GET</code></td><td data-start="1651" data-end="1680" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1653" data-end="1679">/api/users/:id/favorites</code></td><td data-start="1680" data-end="1704" data-col-size="sm">Get user’s favorites</td></tr><tr data-start="1705" data-end="1767"><td data-start="1705" data-end="1714" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1707" data-end="1713">POST</code></td><td data-start="1714" data-end="1743" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1716" data-end="1742">/api/users/:id/favorites</code></td><td data-start="1743" data-end="1767" data-col-size="sm">Add/remove favorites</td></tr><tr data-start="1768" data-end="1823"><td data-start="1768" data-end="1776" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1770" data-end="1775">GET</code></td><td data-start="1776" data-end="1799" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1778" data-end="1798">/api/quiz/:plantId</code></td><td data-start="1799" data-end="1823" data-col-size="sm">Get quiz for a plant</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7969px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.440