gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="229">Perfect 🌿 — we’ll now build the <strong data-start="33" data-end="74">frontend (React + Vite + TailwindCSS)</strong> for your <strong data-start="84" data-end="109">Virtual Herbal Garden</strong> project.<br data-start="118" data-end="121">
This setup will give you a <strong data-start="148" data-end="164">ready-to-run</strong> modern web app with a clean UI, routing, and modular components.</p>
<hr data-start="231" data-end="234">
<h2 data-start="236" data-end="282">⚛️ Frontend Setup (Vite + React + Tailwind)</h2>
<h3 data-start="284" data-end="308">🧩 Folder: <code data-start="299" data-end="308">/client</code></h3>
<h4 data-start="310" data-end="338">1. Initialize React App</h4>
<p data-start="339" data-end="356">In your terminal:</p>
