</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="473" data-end="552">Then open this folder in VS Code:<br data-start="506" data-end="509">
<strong data-start="509" data-end="552">File → Open Folder → select your folder</strong></p>
<hr data-start="554" data-end="557">
<h3 data-start="559" data-end="590">🔹 3. Open VS Code Terminal</h3>
<p data-start="591" data-end="625">Inside VS Code, open the terminal:</p>
