057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Create a new Vite + React app named 'client'</span></span><span>
npm create vite@latest client -- --template react

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Move into the new folder</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span></span><span> client

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Install dependencies</span></span><span>
npm install
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="997" data-end="1059">✅ This sets up a new Vite project in a folder called <code data-start="1050" data-end="1058">client</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="1061" data-end="1064">
