<p data-start="2582" data-end="2697">✅ Click the link or copy-paste it in your browser →<br data-start="2633" data-end="2636">
<strong data-start="2636" data-end="2697">You’ll see your Virtual Herbal Garden web app running! 🌿</strong></p>
<hr data-start="2699" data-end="2702">
<h3 data-start="2704" data-end="2732">🧠 Optional Enhancements</h3>
<p data-start="2734" data-end="2801">If you want <strong data-start="2746" data-end="2791">to get better grades or make it stand out</strong>, you can:</p>
<ul data-start="2802" data-end="3044">
<li data-start="2802" data-end="2857">
<p data-start="2804" data-end="2857">Add <strong data-start="2808" data-end="2827">real plant data</strong> from AYUSH or botanical APIs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2858" data-end="2915">
<p data-start="2860" data-end="2915">Add <strong data-start="2864" data-end="2886">images &amp; 3D models</strong> using <code data-start="2893" data-end="2909">&lt;model-viewer&gt;</code> tags.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2916" data-end="2972">
<p data-start="2918" data-end="2972">Deploy it to <strong data-start="2931" data-end="2941">Vercel</strong> or <strong data-start="2945" data-end="2956">Netlify</strong> (free hosting).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2973" data-end="3044">
<p data-start="2975" data-end="3044">Add a backend later (Node.js + MongoDB for favorites and user login).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3046" data-end="3049">
<p data-start="3051" data-end="3290" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to give you a <strong data-start="3083" data-end="3117">ready-to-copy folder structure</strong> and files (like <code data-start="3134" data-end="3144">main.jsx</code>, <code data-start="3146" data-end="3157">index.css</code>, <code data-start="3159" data-end="3179">tailwind.config.js</code>, etc.) that you can directly paste into VS Code?<br data-start="3228" data-end="3231">
