<p data-start="558" data-end="614">If this works → you're done 🎉<br data-start="588" data-end="591">
If not, continue below.</p>
<hr data-start="616" data-end="619">
<h1 data-start="621" data-end="678">✅ FIX 2 — Delete corrupted <code data-start="650" data-end="664">node_modules</code> and reinstall</h1>
<p data-start="679" data-end="712">Inside your <code data-start="691" data-end="699">client</code> folder, run:</p>
