<hr data-start="1152" data-end="1155">
<h1 data-start="1157" data-end="1211">✅ FIX 4 — Remove PowerShell Execution Restrictions</h1>
<p data-start="1212" data-end="1284">On some Dell/Windows systems, <strong data-start="1242" data-end="1283">PowerShell blocks running NPX scripts</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="1286" data-end="1327">Run this in <strong data-start="1298" data-end="1326">administrator PowerShell</strong>:</p>
