<p data-start="964" data-end="1017">⚡ <strong data-start="966" data-end="1017">This fixes 90% of Windows/Vite/Tailwind errors.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1019" data-end="1022">
<h1 data-start="1024" data-end="1062">⚠️ If the SAME ERROR appears again</h1>
<p data-start="1063" data-end="1109">It means <strong data-start="1072" data-end="1108">your Node installation is broken</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="1111" data-end="1124">Then do this:</p>
<h1 data-start="1126" data-end="1169">✅ Step 3 — Reinstall Node.js (PROPER FIX)</h1>
<ol data-start="1171" data-end="1287">
<li data-start="1171" data-end="1206">
<p data-start="1174" data-end="1206">Go to:<br data-start="1180" data-end="1183">
<a data-start="1186" data-end="1204" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://nodejs.org/">https://nodejs.org<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><path d="M14.3349 13.3301V6.60645L5.47065 15.4707C5.21095 15.7304 4.78895 15.7304 4.52925 15.4707C4.26955 15.211 4.26955 14.789 4.52925 14.5293L13.3935 5.66504H6.66011C6.29284 5.66504 5.99507 5.36727 5.99507 5C5.99507 4.63273 6.29284 4.33496 6.66011 4.33496H14.9999L15.1337 4.34863C15.4369 4.41057 15.665 4.67857 15.665 5V13.3301C15.6649 13.6973 15.3672 13.9951 14.9999 13.9951C14.6327 13.9951 14.335 13.6973 14.3349 13.3301Z"></path></svg></span></a></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1207" data-end="1236">
<p data-start="1210" data-end="1236">Download <strong data-start="1219" data-end="1234">LTS version</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1237" data-end="1267">
<p data-start="1240" data-end="1267">Install → restart VS Code</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1268" data-end="1287">
<p data-start="1271" data-end="1287">Run these again:</p>
