<p data-start="1395" data-end="1451">If it gives <strong data-start="1407" data-end="1419">no error</strong>, Tailwind is working perfectly.</p>
<hr data-start="1453" data-end="1456">
<h1 data-start="1458" data-end="1508">🎉 <strong data-start="1463" data-end="1508">This Method Works Even When NPX Is Broken</strong></h1>
<p data-start="1509" data-end="1524">You don’t need:</p>
<p data-start="1526" data-end="1577">❌ npx tailwind<br data-start="1540" data-end="1543">
❌ npm tailwind<br data-start="1557" data-end="1560">
❌ yarn tailwind</p>
<p data-start="1579" data-end="1625">Tailwind works <strong data-start="1594" data-end="1606">directly</strong> from the EXE file.</p>
<hr data-start="1627" data-end="1630">
