<h1 data-start="1918" data-end="1938">💬 PLEASE TELL ME:</h1>
<p data-start="1939" data-end="1957">Do you want me to:</p>
<h3 data-start="1959" data-end="2033">✔ Send you the direct download link for <code data-start="2003" data-end="2032">tailwindcss-windows-x64.exe</code>?</h3>
<h3 data-start="2034" data-end="2093">✔ Or help you install Node properly so NPX works again?</h3>
