ated-link" href="http://localhost:5174/">http://localhost:5174/<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><path d="M14.3349 13.3301V6.60645L5.47065 15.4707C5.21095 15.7304 4.78895 15.7304 4.52925 15.4707C4.26955 15.211 4.26955 14.789 4.52925 14.5293L13.3935 5.66504H6.66011C6.29284 5.66504 5.99507 5.36727 5.99507 5C5.99507 4.63273 6.29284 4.33496 6.66011 4.33496H14.9999L15.1337 4.34863C15.4369 4.41057 15.665 4.67857 15.665 5V13.3301C15.6649 13.6973 15.3672 13.9951 14.9999 13.9951C14.6327 13.9951 14.335 13.6973 14.3349 13.3301Z"></path></svg></span></a></strong> — means your <strong data-start="58" data-end="109">Vite development server is running successfully</strong> 🎉🌿</p>
<p data-start="118" data-end="189">Now tell me what you are seeing on that page so I can help you further:</p>
<hr data-start="191" data-end="194">
<h2 data-start="196" data-end="219">✅ Please choose one:</h2>
<h3 data-start="221" data-end="260"><strong data-start="225" data-end="260">1️⃣ The project is working fine</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="261" data-end="360">
<li data-start="261" data-end="315">
<p data-start="263" data-end="315">You can see the <strong data-start="279" data-end="295">Vite + React</strong> starter page<br data-start="308" data-end="311">
or</p>
</li>
<li data-start="316" data-end="360">
<p data-start="318" data-end="360">You see the <strong data-start="330" data-end="358">Virtual Herbal Garden UI</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="362" data-end="445">If yes → your setup is correct ✔<br data-start="394" data-end="397">
Next step: paste <strong data-start="414" data-end="425">App.jsx</strong> into <code data-start="431" data-end="444">src/App.jsx</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="447" data-end="450">
<h3 data-start="452" data-end="496"><strong data-start="456" data-end="496">2️⃣ The page is blank / white screen</strong></h3>
<p data-start="497" data-end="565">If you see <strong data-start="508" data-end="519">nothing</strong> or a <strong data-start="525" data-end="539">white page</strong>, tell me and I’ll fix it.</p>
<hr data-start="567" data-end="570">
<h3 data-start="572" data-end="609"><strong data-start="576" data-end="609">3️⃣ It shows an error message</strong></h3>
