</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="784" data-end="897">(If you prefer CDN, you can use a script tag in <code data-start="832" data-end="844">index.html</code> — I recommend the npm package for dev environments.)</p>
<p data-start="899" data-end="948">Then import it once (I recommend <code data-start="932" data-end="946">src/main.jsx</code>):</p>
