n-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="222">Great question — <strong data-start="17" data-end="70">I’ll show you EXACTLY where to paste this section</strong> inside your existing <code data-start="92" data-end="110">PlantDetailModal</code> so it works perfectly.<br data-start="133" data-end="136">
You <strong data-start="140" data-end="187">replace the OLD “Interactive Tools” section</strong> with the NEW AR + 3D viewer block.</p>
<hr data-start="224" data-end="227">
<h1 data-start="229" data-end="267">✅ <strong data-start="233" data-end="267">Where to Insert the 3D/AR Code</strong></h1>
<p data-start="269" data-end="329">Open your <code data-start="279" data-end="288">App.jsx</code> → find the <code data-start="300" data-end="318">PlantDetailModal</code> component.</p>
<p data-start="331" data-end="361">Inside it, look for this part:</p>
