ass="ͼw">React</span> <span class="ͼs">from</span> <span class="ͼt">'react'</span></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼs">import</span> <span class="ͼw">ReactDOM</span> <span class="ͼs">from</span> <span class="ͼt">'react-dom/client'</span></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼs">import</span> <span class="ͼw">App</span> <span class="ͼs">from</span> <span class="ͼt">'./App'</span></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼs">import</span> <span class="ͼt">'./index.css'</span></div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼw">ReactDOM</span>.<span class="ͼv">createRoot</span>(<span class="ͼw">document</span>.<span class="ͼv">getElementById</span>(<span class="ͼt">'root'</span>)).<span class="ͼv">render</span>(</div><div class="cm-line">  &lt;<span class="ͼr">React</span>.<span class="ͼr">StrictMode</span>&gt;</div><div class="cm-line">    &lt;<span class="ͼr">App</span> /&gt;</div><div class="cm-line">  &lt;/<span class="ͼr">React</span>.<span class="ͼr">StrictMode</span>&gt;</div><div class="cm-line">)</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼp">// ===================== index.css =====================</span></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼp">// Place this file in: client/src/index.css</span></div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼq">@</span><span class="ͼw">tailwind</span> <span class="ͼw">base</span>;</div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼq">@</span><span class="ͼw">tailwind</span> <span class="ͼw">components</span>;</div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼq">@</span><span class="ͼw">tailwind</span> <span class="ͼw">utilities</span>;</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼw">body </span>{</div><div class="cm-line">  <span class="ͼq">@</span><span class="ͼw">apply</span> <span class="ͼw">bg</span>-<span class="ͼw">green</span>-<span class="ͼu">50</span> <span class="ͼw">text</span>-<span class="ͼw">gray</span>-<span class="ͼu">800</span>;</div><div class="cm-line">}</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼp">// ===================== tailwind.config.js =====================</span></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼp">// Place this file in: client/tailwind.config.js</span></div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼp">/** @type {import('tailwindcss').Config} */</span></div><div class="cm-line"><span class="ͼw">module</span>.<span class="ͼv">exports</span> = {</div><div class="cm-line">  <span class="ͼv">content</span>: [</div><div class="cm-line">    <span class="ͼt">"./index.html"</span>,</div><div class="cm-line">    <span class="ͼt">"./src/**/*.{js,jsx,ts,tsx}"</span>,</div><div class="cm-line">  ],</div><div class="cm-gap" style="height: 84px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="4c94b943-0075-4a6f-9f59-2b0de8e1286d" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="148">It looks like the replacement failed because the <strong data-start="49" data-end="66">exact section</strong> in your App.jsx didn’t match the pattern (different spacing, text, or structure).</p>
<p data-start="150" data-end="206">To fix this <em data-start="162" data-end="173">perfectly</em>, I need you to do <strong data-start="192" data-end="205">one thing</strong>:</p>
<p data-start="208" data-end="330">👉 <strong data-start="211" data-end="275">Please paste ONLY the full <code data-start="240" data-end="258">PlantDetailModal</code> component here</strong><br data-start="275" data-end="278">
(from <code data-start="284" data-end="318">function PlantDetailModal(...) {</code> until <code data-start="325" data-end="328">}</code> )</p>
<p data-start="332" data-end="350">Once you paste it:</p>
<p data-start="352" data-end="501">✅ I will insert the updated AR/3D section <strong data-start="394" data-end="420">inside your exact code</strong><br data-start="420" data-end="423">
✅ Then I will update the canvas automatically<br data-start="468" data-end="471">
✅ No errors<br data-start="482" data-end="485">
