<p data-start="0" data-end="178">Perfect — now that I can see the <strong data-start="33" data-end="46">structure</strong>, I will give you a <strong data-start="66" data-end="112">ready-to-paste complete <code data-start="92" data-end="110">PlantDetailModal</code></strong> with the AR + 3D <code data-start="130" data-end="146">&lt;model-viewer&gt;</code> section <strong data-start="155" data-end="177">correctly inserted</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="180" data-end="267">You only need to <strong data-start="197" data-end="247">replace your entire current <code data-start="227" data-end="245">PlantDetailModal</code></strong> with the one below.</p>
<hr data-start="269" data-end="272">
<h1 data-start="274" data-end="334">✅ <strong data-start="278" data-end="332">FULL Updated <code data-start="293" data-end="311">PlantDetailModal</code> (Copy–Paste Ready)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="335" data-end="461">👉 This version includes:<br data-start="360" data-end="363">
✔ Overview section<br data-start="381" data-end="384">
✔ 3D viewer + AR support<br data-start="408" data-end="411">
✔ Safety notes<br data-start="425" data-end="428">
✔ References<br data-start="440" data-end="443">
✔ Footer buttons</p>
<hr data-start="463" data-end="466">
<h3 data-start="468" data-end="542"><strong data-start="472" data-end="542">📌 Paste this into your App.jsx (replace the old PlantDetailModal)</strong></h3>
