lex-row"><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-0.5"><span class="font-medium"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 truncate text-start align-middle text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary dark:text-[var(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)]" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for 4 seconds<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><path d="M7.52925 3.7793C7.75652 3.55203 8.10803 3.52383 8.36616 3.69434L8.47065 3.7793L14.2207 9.5293C14.4804 9.789 14.4804 10.211 14.2207 10.4707L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z"></path></svg></span></span></button></div></div><div class="max-w-[calc(0.8*var(--thread-content-max-width,40rem))]"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="5b5ad2e4-aa13-4c0a-ac37-14c8d3a6432f" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-t-mini"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="144">Awesome — 200 marks is a big opportunity. Let’s turn your <strong data-start="58" data-end="83">Virtual Herbal Garden</strong> into a high-scoring, professor-proof project. I’ll give you:</p>
<ol data-start="146" data-end="482">
<li data-start="146" data-end="192">
<p data-start="149" data-end="192">A clear <strong data-start="157" data-end="176">marks breakdown</strong> (out of 200).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="193" data-end="278">
<p data-start="196" data-end="278">A concrete <strong data-start="207" data-end="233">deliverables checklist</strong> for each section with acceptance criteria.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="279" data-end="406">
<p data-start="282" data-end="406">Ready-to-use <strong data-start="295" data-end="319">templates &amp; commands</strong> you can copy (README, report structure, PPT slide list, deployment &amp; test commands).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="407" data-end="482">
<p data-start="410" data-end="482"><strong data-start="410" data-end="432">Extra-credit ideas</strong> you can add if you want to push beyond 200/200.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="484" data-end="747">I’ll keep this practical so you can start ticking boxes immediately. If you want, I can generate any of the files below (report, slides, README, backend scaffold, test suite, CI yml, sample GLBs, demo script) — just tell me which and I’ll produce them right away.</p>
<hr data-start="749" data-end="752">
<h1 data-start="754" data-end="800">1) Suggested marks breakdown (total <strong data-start="792" data-end="799">200</strong>)</h1>
<p data-start="802" data-end="887">(This is a suggested rubric you can use to align work to likely evaluation criteria.)</p>
<ul data-start="889" data-end="2341">
<li data-start="889" data-end="1097">
<p data-start="891" data-end="922"><strong data-start="891" data-end="922">Frontend UI &amp; UX — 50 marks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="925" data-end="1097">
<li data-start="925" data-end="996">
<p data-start="927" data-end="996">Clean, responsive UI, Tailwind styling, accessibility, animations: 25</p>
</li>
<li data-start="999" data-end="1051">
<p data-start="1001" data-end="1051">Search, filtering, details modal, favorites UI: 15</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1054" data-end="1097">
<p data-start="1056" data-end="1097">AR/3D integration + graceful fallback: 10</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1099" data-end="1353">
<p data-start="1101" data-end="1141"><strong data-start="1101" data-end="1141">Backend &amp; Data (API + DB) — 50 marks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1144" data-end="1353">
<li data-start="1144" data-end="1224">
<p data-start="1146" data-end="1224">REST API design, endpoints implemented (plants, users, favorites, quizzes): 25</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1227" data-end="1281">
<p data-start="1229" data-end="1281">Data modeling, seed script, secure config (.env): 10</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1284" data-end="1353">
<p data-start="1286" data-end="1353">Authentication (basic JWT) and persistence of favorites/quizzes: 15</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1355" data-end="1589">
<p data-start="1357" data-end="1394"><strong data-start="1357" data-end="1394">Documentation &amp; Report — 30 marks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1397" data-end="1589">
<li data-start="1397" data-end="1479">
<p data-start="1399" data-end="1479">Well-structured final report (abstract, intro, methods, results, conclusion): 15</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1482" data-end="1526">
<p data-start="1484" data-end="1526">README + setup instructions + API docs: 10</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1529" data-end="1589">
<p data-start="1531" data-end="1589">References &amp; attributions (AYUSH sources, model assets): 5</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1591" data-end="1779">
<p data-start="1593" data-end="1628"><strong data-start="1593" data-end="1628">Demo &amp; Functionality — 20 marks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1631" data-end="1779">
<li data-start="1631" data-end="1714">
<p data-start="1633" data-end="1714">Working local demo, recorded walkthrough video (2–4 min) and live demo script: 10</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1717" data-end="1779">
<p data-start="1719" data-end="1779">End-to-end flows (search → detail → add favorite → quiz): 10</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1781" data-end="1960">
<p data-start="1783" data-end="1818"><strong data-start="1783" data-end="1818">Code Quality &amp; Tests — 20 marks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1821" data-end="1960">
<li data-start="1821" data-end="1910">
<p data-start="1823" data-end="1910">Modular code, comments, linting (ESLint), unit tests (Vitest/React Testing Library): 10</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1913" data-end="1960">
<p data-start="1915" data-end="1960">CI (GitHub Actions) running tests &amp; build: 10</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1962" data-end="2068">
<p data-start="1964" data-end="2004"><strong data-start="1964" data-end="2004">Accessibility &amp; Usability — 10 marks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2007" data-end="2068">
<li data-start="2007" data-end="2068">
<p data-start="2009" data-end="2068">Keyboard navigation, ARIA labels, color contrast report: 10</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="2070" data-end="2201">
<p data-start="2072" data-end="2127"><strong data-start="2072" data-end="2127">Originality, References &amp; Extra Features — 10 marks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2130" data-end="2201">
<li data-start="2130" data-end="2201">
<p data-start="2132" data-end="2201">Novel features (AR tour, model viewer, learning paths), citations: 10</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="2203" data-end="2341">
<p data-start="2205" data-end="2261"><strong data-start="2205" data-end="2261">Extra credit (optional, bumpable to 200+) — 10 marks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2264" data-end="2341">
<li data-start="2264" data-end="2341">
<p data-start="2266" data-end="2341">AR mobile testing evidence, deployed site, admin upload console, analytics.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2343" data-end="2346">
<h1 data-start="2348" data-end="2417">2) Deliverables checklist (what to prepare &amp; how to get full marks)</h1>
<p data-start="2419" data-end="2509">I'll list each deliverable + acceptance criteria + example files to include in submission.</p>
<hr data-start="2511" data-end="2514">
<h2 data-start="2516" data-end="2586">A. Frontend (deliver: <code data-start="2541" data-end="2550">client/</code> folder + deployed URL) — (50 marks)</h2>
<p data-start="2587" data-end="2596"><strong data-start="2587" data-end="2596">Tasks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2597" data-end="2954">
<li data-start="2597" data-end="2640">
<p data-start="2599" data-end="2640">Responsive React app (Vite) + Tailwind.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2641" data-end="2706">
<p data-start="2643" data-end="2706">Search, filter by AYUSH system, sorting, favorites persisted.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2707" data-end="2773">
<p data-start="2709" data-end="2773">Plant detail modal: images, scientific name, uses, references.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2774" data-end="2877">
<p data-start="2776" data-end="2877">Integrate <code data-start="2786" data-end="2800">model-viewer</code> for <code data-start="2805" data-end="2811">.glb</code> models, <code data-start="2820" data-end="2829">ios-src</code> for <code data-start="2834" data-end="2841">.usdz</code>. Show fallback image if no model.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2878" data-end="2915">
<p data-start="2880" data-end="2915">Learning paths &amp; mini-quiz pages.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2916" data-end="2954">
<p data-start="2918" data-end="2954">AR button / instructions for mobile.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2956" data-end="2979"><strong data-start="2956" data-end="2979">Acceptance criteria</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2980" data-end="3234">
<li data-start="2980" data-end="3019">
<p data-start="2982" data-end="3019">Works on desktop and mobile widths.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3020" data-end="3074">
<p data-start="3022" data-end="3074">Favorite state persists (localStorage or backend).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3075" data-end="3143">
<p data-start="3077" data-end="3143">Clicking a plant opens modal with 3D viewer when <code data-start="3126" data-end="3133">model</code> exists.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3144" data-end="3234">
<p data-start="3146" data-end="3234">Keyboard accessible (tab focus + Enter activates cards), ARIA labels for major controls.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3236" data-end="3256"><strong data-start="3236" data-end="3256">Files to include</strong></p>
<ul data-start="3257" data-end="3416">
<li data-start="3257" data-end="3304">
<p data-start="3259" data-end="3304"><code data-start="3259" data-end="3273">client/src/*</code> (components, pages, App.jsx)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3305" data-end="3365">
<p data-start="3307" data-end="3365"><code data-start="3307" data-end="3335">client/public/models/*.glb</code> (or links to hosted models)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3366" data-end="3416">
<p data-start="3368" data-end="3416"><code data-start="3368" data-end="3389">client/package.json</code>, <code data-start="3391" data-end="3402">README.md</code>, <code data-start="3404" data-end="3416">index.html</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3418" data-end="3436"><strong data-start="3418" data-end="3436">Quick commands</strong></p>
<ul data-start="3437" data-end="3503">
<li data-start="3437" data-end="3452">
<p data-start="3439" data-end="3452"><code data-start="3439" data-end="3452">npm install</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3453" data-end="3468">
<p data-start="3455" data-end="3468"><code data-start="3455" data-end="3468">npm run dev</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3469" data-end="3503">
<p data-start="3471" data-end="3503"><code data-start="3471" data-end="3486">npm run build</code> (for production)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3505" data-end="3508">
<h2 data-start="3510" data-end="3586">B. Backend &amp; Data (deliver: <code data-start="3541" data-end="3550">server/</code> folder + deployed API) — (50 marks)</h2>
<p data-start="3587" data-end="3596"><strong data-start="3587" data-end="3596">Tasks</strong></p>
<ul data-start="3597" data-end="4053">
<li data-start="3597" data-end="3646">
<p data-start="3599" data-end="3646">Node.js + Express + MongoDB (Atlas or local).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3647" data-end="3683">
<p data-start="3649" data-end="3683">Models: <code data-start="3657" data-end="3664">Plant</code>, <code data-start="3666" data-end="3672">User</code>, <code data-start="3674" data-end="3680">Quiz</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3684" data-end="3949">
<p data-start="3686" data-end="3701">REST endpoints:</p>
<ul data-start="3704" data-end="3949">
<li data-start="3704" data-end="3767">
<p data-start="3706" data-end="3767"><code data-start="3706" data-end="3723">GET /api/plants</code> — list (support search/filter query params)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3770" data-end="3793">
<p data-start="3772" data-end="3793"><code data-start="3772" data-end="3793">GET /api/plants/:id</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3796" data-end="3849">
<p data-start="3798" data-end="3849"><code data-start="3798" data-end="3824">POST /api/users/register</code>, <code data-start="3826" data-end="3849">POST /api/users/login</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3852" data-end="3920">
<p data-start="3854" data-end="3920"><code data-start="3854" data-end="3884">GET /api/users/:id/favorites</code> and <code data-start="3889" data-end="3920">POST /api/users/:id/favorites</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3923" data-end="3949">
<p data-start="3925" data-end="3949"><code data-start="3925" data-end="3949">GET /api/quiz/:plantId</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="3950" data-end="4012">
<p data-start="3952" data-end="4012">Seed script to populate DB with the plants used in frontend.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4013" data-end="4053">
<p data-start="4015" data-end="4053">Secure <code data-start="4022" data-end="4028">.env</code> for DB URI + JWT secret.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4055" data-end="4078"><strong data-start="4055" data-end="4078">Acceptance criteria</strong></p>
<ul data-start="4079" data-end="4225">
<li data-start="4079" data-end="4143">
<p data-start="4081" data-end="4143">API responds JSON and supports CORS for the frontend domain.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4144" data-end="4181">
<p data-start="4146" data-end="4181">Favorites are persisted per user.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4182" data-end="4225">
<p data-start="4184" data-end="4225">Seed script works: <code data-start="4203" data-end="4224">node server/seed.js</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4227" data-end="4247"><strong data-start="4227" data-end="4247">Files to include</strong></p>
<ul data-start="4248" data-end="4362">
<li data-start="4248" data-end="4362">
<p data-start="4250" data-end="4362"><code data-start="4250" data-end="4271">server/package.json</code>, <code data-start="4273" data-end="4291">server/server.js</code>, <code data-start="4293" data-end="4313">server/routes/*.js</code>, <code data-start="4315" data-end="4335">server/models/*.js</code>, <code data-start="4337" data-end="4351">.env.example</code>, <code data-start="4353" data-end="4362">seed.js</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4364" data-end="4382"><strong data-start="4364" data-end="4382">Quick commands</strong></p>
<ul data-start="4383" data-end="4471">
<li data-start="4383" data-end="4398">
<p data-start="4385" data-end="4398"><code data-start="4385" data-end="4398">npm install</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4399" data-end="4422">
<p data-start="4401" data-end="4422"><code data-start="4401" data-end="4422">node server/seed.js</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4423" data-end="4471">
<p data-start="4425" data-end="4471"><code data-start="4425" data-end="4448">node server/server.js</code> or <code data-start="4452" data-end="4471">nodemon server.js</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="4473" data-end="4476">
<h2 data-start="4478" data-end="4556">C. Documentation &amp; Report (deliver: <code data-start="4517" data-end="4529">REPORT.pdf</code>, <code data-start="4531" data-end="4542">README.md</code>) — (30 marks)</h2>
<p data-start="4557" data-end="4603"><strong data-start="4557" data-end="4603">Report structure (recommended ~8–12 pages)</strong></p>
<ol data-start="4604" data-end="5093">
<li data-start="4604" data-end="4656">
<p data-start="4607" data-end="4656">Title page (project name, authors, guide, date)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4657" data-end="4686">
<p data-start="4660" data-end="4686">Abstract (150–200 words)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4687" data-end="4733">
<p data-start="4690" data-end="4733">Introduction &amp; Motivation (AYUSH context)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4734" data-end="4757">
<p data-start="4737" data-end="4757">Objectives &amp; Scope</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4758" data-end="4806">
<p data-start="4761" data-end="4806">Architecture &amp; Tech Stack (include diagram)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4807" data-end="4862">
<p data-start="4810" data-end="4862">Implementation details (frontend, backend, AR, 3D)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4863" data-end="4906">
<p data-start="4866" data-end="4906">Dataset &amp; Models (plant list, sources)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4907" data-end="4959">
<p data-start="4910" data-end="4959">Testing &amp; Validation (unit tests, device tests)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4960" data-end="5009">
<p data-start="4963" data-end="5009">Demo &amp; Results (screenshots + link to video)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5010" data-end="5041">
<p data-start="5014" data-end="5041">Limitations &amp; Future Work</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5042" data-end="5093">
<p data-start="5046" data-end="5093">References (papers, AYUSH texts, model sources)</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="5095" data-end="5114"><strong data-start="5095" data-end="5114">README contents</strong></p>
<ul data-start="5115" data-end="5305">
<li data-start="5115" data-end="5157">
<p data-start="5117" data-end="5157">Quick start (install, dev, build, run)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5158" data-end="5200">
<p data-start="5160" data-end="5200">API docs (endpoints + sample requests)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5201" data-end="5260">
<p data-start="5203" data-end="5260">Deployment instructions (Vercel, Render, MongoDB Atlas)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5261" data-end="5305">
<p data-start="5263" data-end="5305">Notes about AR support and testing devices</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="5307" data-end="5310">
<h2 data-start="5312" data-end="5379">D. Demo &amp; Video (deliver: <code data-start="5341" data-end="5351">demo.mp4</code> + demo script) — (20 marks)</h2>
<p data-start="5380" data-end="5399"><strong data-start="5380" data-end="5399">What to include</strong></p>
<ul data-start="5400" data-end="5617">
<li data-start="5400" data-end="5567">
<p data-start="5402" data-end="5567">2–4 minute screen recording: show homepage, search, open Tulsi, 3D viewer, AR launch on phone (if possible), add favorite, take quiz, show admin upload (if built).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5568" data-end="5617">
<p data-start="5570" data-end="5617">Keep a short script (what to say in each step).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5619" data-end="5633"><strong data-start="5619" data-end="5633">Acceptance</strong></p>
<ul data-start="5634" data-end="5694">
<li data-start="5634" data-end="5694">
