01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Virtual Herbal Garden</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">## Quick start (frontend)</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span></span><span> client
npm install
npm run dev
Open http://localhost:5174

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">## Quick start (backend)</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span></span><span> server
npm install
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">cp</span></span><span> .env.example .</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">env</span></span><span>  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># fill MONGODB_URI and JWT_SECRET</span></span><span>
node seed.js
node server.js

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">## Features</span></span><span>
- Browse AYUSH medicinal plants
- 3D model &amp; AR preview (model-viewer)
- Favorites &amp; quizzes
- Learning paths

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">## API Endpoints</span></span><span>
GET /api/plants
GET /api/plants/:</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">id</span></span><span>
POST /api/users/register
POST /api/users/login
GET /api/users/:</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">id</span></span><span>/favorites
POST /api/users/:</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">id</span></span><span>/favorites

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">## Deployment</span></span><span>
Frontend: Vercel (push client/ directory)  
Backend: Render/Heroku (server/) + MongoDB Atlas

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">## Reference</span></span><span>
List of AYUSH references and 3D model sources...
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
