<p data-start="9093" data-end="9103"><strong data-start="9093" data-end="9103">Deploy</strong></p>
<ul data-start="9104" data-end="9438">
<li data-start="9104" data-end="9239">
<p data-start="9106" data-end="9239">Frontend -&gt; Vercel: <code data-start="9126" data-end="9134">vercel</code> or connect GitHub repo; set build command <code data-start="9177" data-end="9192">npm run build</code> in project root or point to <code data-start="9221" data-end="9229">client</code> folder.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9240" data-end="9362">
<p data-start="9242" data-end="9362">Backend -&gt; Render: create new web service, set start command <code data-start="9303" data-end="9319">node server.js</code>, set environment variables in dashboard.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9363" data-end="9438">
<p data-start="9365" data-end="9438">Database -&gt; MongoDB Atlas: create cluster, get URI, set in server <code data-start="9431" data-end="9437">.env</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="9440" data-end="9443">
<h1 data-start="9445" data-end="9510">6) Extra credit features (choose 1–3; each can add +5–10 marks)</h1>
<ul data-start="9511" data-end="9884">
<li data-start="9511" data-end="9613">
<p data-start="9513" data-end="9613">Add <strong data-start="9517" data-end="9532">admin panel</strong> to add/edit plant entries and upload <code data-start="9570" data-end="9576">.glb</code> models (React + protected routes).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9614" data-end="9700">
<p data-start="9616" data-end="9700">Analytics: record user quiz scores and favorites and show basic charts (Recharts).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9701" data-end="9739">
<p data-start="9703" data-end="9739">Export &amp; print PDF plant profiles.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9740" data-end="9824">
<p data-start="9742" data-end="9824">Add offline support (Service Worker) so the app works offline for core features.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9825" data-end="9884">
<p data-start="9827" data-end="9884">Add multi-language support (English + regional language).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="9886" data-end="9889">
<h1 data-start="9891" data-end="9954">7) Prioritized sprint plan (you can follow to finish quickly)</h1>
<p data-start="9956" data-end="9973"><strong data-start="9956" data-end="9973">Week 1 (Core)</strong></p>
<ul data-start="9974" data-end="10104">
<li data-start="9974" data-end="10035">
<p data-start="9976" data-end="10035">Finalize frontend UI + data (PLANTS list) — 50 marks tasks.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="10036" data-end="10104">
<p data-start="10038" data-end="10104">Add sample GLBs (or public model links), integrate <code data-start="10089" data-end="10103">model-viewer</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="10106" data-end="10140"><strong data-start="10106" data-end="10140">Week 2 (Backend + Persistence)</strong></p>
<ul data-start="10141" data-end="10210">
<li data-start="10141" data-end="10210">
<p data-start="10143" data-end="10210">Build Express API, seed DB, JWT auth, persist favorites — 50 marks.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="10212" data-end="10238"><strong data-start="10212" data-end="10238">Week 3 (Polish &amp; Docs)</strong></p>
<ul data-start="10239" data-end="10311">
<li data-start="10239" data-end="10311">
<p data-start="10241" data-end="10311">Write final report, README, record demo video, prepare PPT — 40 marks.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="10313" data-end="10344"><strong data-start="10313" data-end="10344">Week 4 (Tests &amp; Deployment)</strong></p>
<ul data-start="10345" data-end="10401">
<li data-start="10345" data-end="10401">
<p data-start="10347" data-end="10401">Add tests, CI, accessibility fixes, deploy — 30 marks.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="10403" data-end="10406">
<h1 data-start="10408" data-end="10458">8) How I can help next (I can produce files now)</h1>
<p data-start="10459" data-end="10580">I can generate any of the following immediately — pick the ones you want and I’ll produce them (ready to paste/download):</p>
<ul data-start="10582" data-end="11043">
<li data-start="10582" data-end="10656">
<p data-start="10584" data-end="10656">✅ Full <strong data-start="10591" data-end="10601">server</strong> scaffold (Express + Mongoose + seed.js + endpoints).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="10657" data-end="10752">
<p data-start="10659" data-end="10752">✅ <code data-start="10661" data-end="10673">REPORT.pdf</code> (draft) based on your app with filled sections and screenshots placeholders.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="10753" data-end="10804">
<p data-start="10755" data-end="10804">✅ <code data-start="10757" data-end="10776">presentation.pptx</code> slides ready to download.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="10805" data-end="10879">
<p data-start="10807" data-end="10879">✅ Demo script &amp; <code data-start="10823" data-end="10833">demo.mp4</code> storyboard (you’ll record on your machine).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="10880" data-end="10948">
<p data-start="10882" data-end="10948">✅ Unit test examples (Vitest + RTL) for two frontend components.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="10949" data-end="10989">
<p data-start="10951" data-end="10989">✅ CI workflow (GitHub Actions YAML).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="10990" data-end="11043">
<p data-start="10992" data-end="11043">✅ Admin panel starter (React) for uploading models.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="11045" data-end="11206" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Tell me which of these to produce first (or say <strong data-start="11093" data-end="11112">“do everything”</strong> and I’ll start with the highest-impact items: server scaffold, report draft, PPT, and tests).</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16