sage relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="202">Got you, Harshitha — <strong data-start="21" data-end="94">a plain/blank page means a React error is happening before rendering.</strong><br data-start="94" data-end="97">
Don’t worry, we will fix it quickly.<br data-start="133" data-end="136">
There are only <strong data-start="151" data-end="172">5 possible causes</strong> — I’ll walk you step-by-step.</p>
<hr data-start="204" data-end="207">
<h1 data-start="209" data-end="258">✅ <strong data-start="213" data-end="258">STEP 1 — Check Browser Console for Errors</strong></h1>
<p data-start="259" data-end="296">Open your project in browser → press:</p>
<p data-start="298" data-end="318">👉 <strong data-start="301" data-end="318">F12 → Console</strong></p>
<p data-start="320" data-end="366">Tell me what error you see:<br data-start="347" data-end="350">
❗ Most likely:</p>
<ul data-start="367" data-end="497">
<li data-start="367" data-end="400">
<p data-start="369" data-end="400"><code data-start="369" data-end="398">model-viewer is not defined</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="401" data-end="425">
<p data-start="403" data-end="425"><code data-start="403" data-end="423">Unexpected token &lt;</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="426" data-end="453">
<p data-start="428" data-end="453"><code data-start="428" data-end="451">PLANTS is not defined</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="454" data-end="478">
<p data-start="456" data-end="478">Error inside App.jsx</p>
</li>
<li data-start="479" data-end="497">
<p data-start="481" data-end="497">Missing import</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="499" data-end="560">Send me the <strong data-start="511" data-end="532">red error message</strong> — I can fix it immediately.</p>
<hr data-start="562" data-end="565">
