</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1793" data-end="1835">Missing even one may cause a blank screen.</p>
<hr data-start="1837" data-end="1840">
<h1 data-start="1842" data-end="1873">👉 I CAN FIX THIS PERFECTLY</h1>
<p data-start="1874" data-end="1908"><strong data-start="1874" data-end="1908">But I need ONE thing from you:</strong></p>
<h3 data-start="1910" data-end="1964">❗ Please copy the ERROR from your browser console.</h3>
<p data-start="1966" data-end="1997">Just send me what you see here:</p>
<p data-start="1999" data-end="2028"><strong data-start="1999" data-end="2028">F12 → Console → red error</strong></p>
<p data-start="2030" data-end="2038">Example:</p>
