text-start"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start justify-between text-start flex-row"><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-0.5"><span class="font-medium"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 truncate text-start align-middle text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary dark:text-[var(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)]" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for 8s<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><path d="M7.52925 3.7793C7.75652 3.55203 8.10803 3.52383 8.36616 3.69434L8.47065 3.7793L14.2207 9.5293C14.4804 9.789 14.4804 10.211 14.2207 10.4707L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z"></path></svg></span></span></button></div></div><div class="max-w-[calc(0.8*var(--thread-content-max-width,40rem))]"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="e9e782cd-dda7-4f16-a2e0-3c4f7c295fda" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-t-mini"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="256">Nice — I’ll give you a ready-to-drop <strong data-start="37" data-end="49">frontend</strong> that includes <strong data-start="64" data-end="91">all five AYUSH sections</strong> (Ayurveda, Yoga &amp; Naturopathy, Unani, Siddha, Homeopathy) and the UI pieces you need to show zone-based exploration, plant cards and the 3D/AR-enabled detail modal.</p>
<p data-start="258" data-end="435">Drop these files into your existing <code data-start="294" data-end="307">client/src/</code> folder (they’re minimal, consistent with the scaffold you already have). After that you can <code data-start="400" data-end="413">npm run dev</code> and visit the routes:</p>
<ul data-start="437" data-end="560">
<li data-start="437" data-end="470">
<p data-start="439" data-end="470"><code data-start="439" data-end="442">/</code> — Home with Zone selector</p>
</li>
<li data-start="471" data-end="528">
<p data-start="473" data-end="528"><code data-start="473" data-end="490">/zone/:zoneName</code> — Zone page (e.g. <code data-start="509" data-end="525">/zone/Ayurveda</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="529" data-end="560">
<p data-start="531" data-end="560">other routes remain as before</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="562" data-end="565">
<h2 data-start="567" data-end="632">1) <code data-start="573" data-end="593">src/data/plants.js</code> — plant dataset (with <code data-start="616" data-end="625">systems</code> field)</h2>
<p data-start="633" data-end="668">Create <code data-start="640" data-end="667">client/src/data/plants.js</code>:</p>
