npm run dev
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># open http://localhost:5174 or 5173 shown by Vite</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="14927" data-end="14930">
<h2 data-start="14932" data-end="14967">Notes &amp; grading tips (200 marks)</h2>
<ul data-start="14968" data-end="15352">
<li data-start="14968" data-end="15067">
<p data-start="14970" data-end="15067">For a top score: fill <code data-start="14992" data-end="15012">References &amp; Notes</code> in <code data-start="15016" data-end="15034">PlantDetailModal</code> with citations for each plant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="15068" data-end="15149">
<p data-start="15070" data-end="15149">Add audio guides files under <code data-start="15099" data-end="15114">public/audio/</code> and add <code data-start="15123" data-end="15130">audio</code> field to plants.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="15150" data-end="15190">
<p data-start="15152" data-end="15190">Add more plants (&gt;= 30) for breadth.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="15191" data-end="15250">
<p data-start="15193" data-end="15250">Add quizzes per plant (save progress to backend later).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="15251" data-end="15352">
<p data-start="15253" data-end="15352">Make sure the site is keyboard accessible and add ARIA labels — I left components accessible-ready.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="15354" data-end="15357">
<p data-start="15359" data-end="15382">If you want, I can now:</p>
<ul data-start="15383" data-end="15649">
<li data-start="15383" data-end="15468">
<p data-start="15385" data-end="15468">Paste these files into your canvas repo so you can download them directly, <strong data-start="15460" data-end="15466">or</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="15469" data-end="15543">
<p data-start="15471" data-end="15543">Generate a <code data-start="15482" data-end="15491">server/</code> scaffold to persist favorites and quizzes, <strong data-start="15535" data-end="15541">or</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="15544" data-end="15649">
<p data-start="15546" data-end="15649">Populate <code data-start="15555" data-end="15563">PLANTS</code> with 50+ entries and produce references for each plant (to meet report requirements).</p>
</li>
</ul>
