<p data-start="1086" data-end="1186">Below are the files (copy/paste). After files, I include install &amp; run commands and asset placement.</p>
<hr data-start="1188" data-end="1191">
<h1 data-start="1193" data-end="1227">Quick install (run in <code data-start="1217" data-end="1226">client/</code>)</h1>
