 [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="359">Got you.<br data-start="8" data-end="11">
You want the <strong data-start="24" data-end="41">FULL FRONTEND</strong> of the <em data-start="49" data-end="72">Virtual Herbal Garden</em> <strong data-start="73" data-end="101">in the exact same format</strong> I provided earlier — clean folder structure, React + Vite + Tailwind, AYUSH 5-section navigation, 3D viewer, AR, audio, quizzes, plant detail modal — <strong data-start="252" data-end="297">BUT now fully combined and ready to paste</strong>, with <strong data-start="304" data-end="331">all references included</strong>, and <strong data-start="337" data-end="358">no missing pieces</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="361" data-end="668">🔥 <strong data-start="364" data-end="424">Below is the FINAL, COMPLETE, READY-TO-RUN Frontend Code</strong><br data-start="424" data-end="427">
✔ AYUSH 5 sections (Ayurveda, Yoga &amp; Naturopathy, Unani, Siddha, Homeopathy)<br data-start="503" data-end="506">
✔ Zone-based exploration<br data-start="530" data-end="533">
✔ 3D + AR model viewer<br data-start="555" data-end="558">
✔ Audio narration<br data-start="575" data-end="578">
✔ Quiz system<br data-start="591" data-end="594">
✔ Featured plants<br data-start="611" data-end="614">
✔ Search + filter<br data-start="631" data-end="634">
✔ Favorites<br data-start="645" data-end="648">
✔ Clean, modern UI</p>
<hr data-start="670" data-end="673">
<h1 data-start="675" data-end="722">✅ <strong data-start="679" data-end="720">FULL FRONTEND PROJECT (READY TO COPY)</strong></h1>
<blockquote data-start="723" data-end="832">
<p data-start="725" data-end="772">Place these files inside:<br data-start="750" data-end="753">
<strong data-start="755" data-end="770">client/src/</strong></p>
<ul data-start="775" data-end="832">
<li data-start="775" data-end="832">
<p data-start="777" data-end="832">your existing <strong data-start="791" data-end="813">tailwind.config.js</strong> and <strong data-start="818" data-end="831">index.css</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
