<hr data-start="983" data-end="986">
<h1 data-start="988" data-end="1055">✅ <strong data-start="992" data-end="1055">Reason 3 — You saved the file but Vite hot reload is broken</strong></h1>
<p data-start="1056" data-end="1072">This happens if:</p>
<ul data-start="1074" data-end="1167">
<li data-start="1074" data-end="1100">
<p data-start="1076" data-end="1100">You have syntax errors</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1101" data-end="1131">
<p data-start="1103" data-end="1131">You did not save all files</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1132" data-end="1167">
<p data-start="1134" data-end="1167">Tailwind config was not updated</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1169" data-end="1195">Check terminal for errors.</p>
<hr data-start="1197" data-end="1200">
<h1 data-start="1202" data-end="1255">✅ <strong data-start="1206" data-end="1255">Reason 4 — Wrong folder is running the server</strong></h1>
