<p data-start="434" data-end="454">✔ That part is fine.</p>
<p data-start="456" data-end="486">BUT the problem STILL remains:</p>
<h1 data-start="488" data-end="530">👉 Your App.jsx is NOT updating the UI</h1>
<p data-start="531" data-end="563">This means one of these is true:</p>
<hr data-start="565" data-end="568">
<h1 data-start="570" data-end="624">🔥 <strong data-start="575" data-end="624">Reason 1 — You have a SYNTAX ERROR in App.jsx</strong></h1>
<p data-start="625" data-end="659">When React/Vite sees an error, it:</p>
<ul data-start="661" data-end="745">
<li data-start="661" data-end="693">
<p data-start="663" data-end="693"><strong data-start="663" data-end="693">stops updating the browser</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="694" data-end="716">
<p data-start="696" data-end="716">keeps showing old UI</p>
</li>
<li data-start="717" data-end="745">
<p data-start="719" data-end="745">server still runs normally</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="747" data-end="798">You will NOT see changes unless the error is fixed.</p>
