<p data-start="1387" data-end="1462">Then App.jsx <strong data-start="1400" data-end="1417">WILL NOT LOAD</strong>.<br data-start="1418" data-end="1421">
Vite will silently load an empty version.</p>
<hr data-start="1464" data-end="1467">
<h1 data-start="1469" data-end="1505">🔥 <strong data-start="1474" data-end="1505">Reason 3 — Incorrect export</strong></h1>
