<hr data-start="1938" data-end="1941">
<h1 data-start="1943" data-end="1969">🚨 IF YOU DON’T SEE IT</h1>
<p data-start="1970" data-end="1981">This means:</p>
<p data-start="1983" data-end="2105">👉 You are editing the WRONG App.jsx<br data-start="2019" data-end="2022">
OR<br data-start="2024" data-end="2027">
👉 main.jsx is loading wrong file<br data-start="2060" data-end="2063">
OR<br data-start="2065" data-end="2068">
👉 Syntax errors blocked hot reload</p>
<hr data-start="2107" data-end="2110">
<h1 data-start="2112" data-end="2158">📸 I NEED TWO SCREENSHOTS TO FIX EVERYTHING:</h1>
<h3 data-start="2160" data-end="2216">1️⃣ Screenshot of your <strong data-start="2187" data-end="2202">src/App.jsx</strong> (full file)</h3>
<h3 data-start="2217" data-end="2257">2️⃣ Screenshot of <strong data-start="2239" data-end="2255">src/main.jsx</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2259" data-end="2318">Without these two, I cannot guarantee which link is broken.</p>
<hr data-start="2320" data-end="2323">
<h1 data-start="2325" data-end="2370">❤️ Once you upload these two screenshots,</h1>
