<p data-start="1491" data-end="1564">❗ This old Vite file <strong data-start="1512" data-end="1534">overrides Tailwind</strong>.<br data-start="1535" data-end="1538">
You must DELETE <code data-start="1554" data-end="1563">App.css</code>.</p>
<p data-start="1566" data-end="1603">And in <strong data-start="1573" data-end="1584">App.jsx</strong>, REMOVE this line:</p>
