<p data-start="1924" data-end="1935">If you see:</p>
<ul data-start="1937" data-end="2006">
<li data-start="1937" data-end="1955">
<p data-start="1939" data-end="1955">module.exports</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1956" data-end="1971">
<p data-start="1958" data-end="1971">wrong paths</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1972" data-end="1989">
<p data-start="1974" data-end="1989">extra slashes</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1990" data-end="2006">
<p data-start="1992" data-end="2006">wrong folder</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2008" data-end="2031">It WILL break Tailwind.</p>
<hr data-start="2033" data-end="2036">
