</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="569" data-end="607">This shows all installed applications.</p>
<hr data-start="609" data-end="612">
<h3 data-start="614" data-end="657">3️⃣ Scroll alphabetically down to <strong data-start="652" data-end="657">N</strong></h3>
<p data-start="659" data-end="668">Look for:</p>
<h3 data-start="670" data-end="687">✔ <strong data-start="676" data-end="687">Node.js</strong></h3>
<p data-start="688" data-end="692">or</p>
<h3 data-start="693" data-end="721">✔ <strong data-start="699" data-end="719">Node.js (64-bit)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="722" data-end="726">or</p>
<h3 data-start="727" data-end="754">✔ <strong data-start="733" data-end="752">Node.js v20.x.x</strong></h3>
<p data-start="755" data-end="759">or</p>
<h3 data-start="760" data-end="787">✔ <strong data-start="766" data-end="785">Node.js Runtime</strong></h3>
<p data-start="789" data-end="819">It has a green icon like this:</p>
<p data-start="821" data-end="835">🟩 <strong data-start="824" data-end="835">Node.js</strong></p>
<hr data-start="837" data-end="840">
<h3 data-start="842" data-end="865">4️⃣ CLICK IT ONCE</h3>
<p data-start="866" data-end="877">Then click:</p>
<h3 data-start="879" data-end="898">❌ <strong data-start="885" data-end="898">Uninstall</strong></h3>
<hr data-start="900" data-end="903">
<p data-start="905" data-end="1035">🔔 <strong data-start="908" data-end="922">IMPORTANT:</strong><br data-start="922" data-end="925">
Do NOT uninstall “npm” or “npx” — they are part of Node.js.<br data-start="984" data-end="987">
Uninstalling Node.js automatically removes them.</p>
<hr data-start="1037" data-end="1040">
<h1 data-start="1042" data-end="1065">📌 WHAT IT LOOKS LIKE</h1>
<p data-start="1067" data-end="1097">You should see something like:</p>
