<p data-start="1139" data-end="1167">Just uninstall <strong data-start="1154" data-end="1166">that one</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1169" data-end="1172">
<h1 data-start="1174" data-end="1211">🧠 Why are we uninstalling Node.js?</h1>
<p data-start="1213" data-end="1282">Because your Node installation is <strong data-start="1247" data-end="1260">corrupted</strong>, causing errors like:</p>
