<p data-start="1417" data-end="1482">Once we reinstall Node properly, your project will work smoothly.</p>
<hr data-start="1484" data-end="1487">
<h1 data-start="1489" data-end="1520">👉 AFTER YOU UNINSTALL NODE</h1>
<p data-start="1521" data-end="1529">Send me:</p>
<h3 data-start="1531" data-end="1611">📸 Screenshot of the “Programs and Features” window showing Node.js removed.</h3>
<p data-start="1613" data-end="1668">Then I will guide you to reinstall the correct version.</p>
<hr data-start="1670" data-end="1673">
<p data-start="1675" data-end="1748">💚 Don’t worry — I will take you step by step until your project becomes:</p>
<p data-start="1750" data-end="1816">✔ fully styled<br data-start="1764" data-end="1767">
✔ fully working<br data-start="1782" data-end="1785">
✔ beautiful 200-marks project</p>
