<p data-start="774" data-end="821">This is how we verify uninstall was successful.</p>
<hr data-start="823" data-end="826">
<h1 data-start="828" data-end="849">🧩 After verifying:</h1>
<h3 data-start="851" data-end="910">3️⃣ I will guide you to reinstall the correct Node.js</h3>
<p data-start="911" data-end="931">(Latest LTS version)</p>
<h3 data-start="933" data-end="979">4️⃣ Then Tailwind will install correctly</h3>
<h3 data-start="980" data-end="1054">5️⃣ Then your UI will immediately become <strong data-start="1025" data-end="1052">styled, clean, colorful</strong></h3>
<h3 data-start="1055" data-end="1126">6️⃣ Then I will paste your <strong data-start="1086" data-end="1124">premium 200-mark enhanced frontend</strong></h3>
