p data-start="0" data-end="81">Perfect, Harshitha — this is <strong data-start="29" data-end="56">EXACTLY what we wanted!</strong> 🎉<br data-start="59" data-end="62">
This message means:</p>
<h1 data-start="83" data-end="144">✅ <strong data-start="87" data-end="142">Node.js is completely uninstalled from your system.</strong></h1>
<p data-start="145" data-end="209">This is the correct state before reinstalling fresh, clean Node.</p>
<p data-start="211" data-end="337">Now your system is ready to install the correct version, and <strong data-start="272" data-end="337">ALL your Tailwind, Vite, npm, and AR/3D issues will be fixed.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="339" data-end="342">
<h1 data-start="344" data-end="398">⭐ NEXT STEP — INSTALL CLEAN NODE.JS (VERY IMPORTANT)</h1>
<h3 data-start="400" data-end="454">👉 Download from this link (Official LTS Version):</h3>
<p data-start="455" data-end="508"><strong data-start="455" data-end="508"><a data-start="457" data-end="506" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://nodejs.org/en/download/prebuilt-installer">https://nodejs.org/en/download/prebuilt-installer<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><path d="M14.3349 13.3301V6.60645L5.47065 15.4707C5.21095 15.7304 4.78895 15.7304 4.52925 15.4707C4.26955 15.211 4.26955 14.789 4.52925 14.5293L13.3935 5.66504H6.66011C6.29284 5.66504 5.99507 5.36727 5.99507 5C5.99507 4.63273 6.29284 4.33496 6.66011 4.33496H14.9999L15.1337 4.34863C15.4369 4.41057 15.665 4.67857 15.665 5V13.3301C15.6649 13.6973 15.3672 13.9951 14.9999 13.9951C14.6327 13.9951 14.335 13.6973 14.3349 13.3301Z"></path></svg></span></a></strong></p>
<p data-start="510" data-end="517">Choose:</p>
<h3 data-start="519" data-end="555">✔ <strong data-start="525" data-end="553">Windows Installer (.msi)</strong></h3>
<h3 data-start="556" data-end="613">✔ <strong data-start="562" data-end="582">Node.js 20.x LTS</strong> (most stable for React + Vite)</h3>
<p data-start="615" data-end="639">Download and install it.</p>
<p data-start="641" data-end="672">During installation, make sure:</p>
<h3 data-start="674" data-end="706">✔ “Add to PATH” is enabled</h3>
<h3 data-start="707" data-end="751">✔ “Install necessary tools” is enabled</h3>
<h3 data-start="752" data-end="785">✔ Press “Next” until Finish</h3>
<hr data-start="787" data-end="790">
<h1 data-start="792" data-end="819">⭐ AFTER INSTALLING NODE</h1>
<p data-start="820" data-end="866">Open a <strong data-start="827" data-end="843">new terminal</strong> (don’t reuse old one).</p>
<p data-start="868" data-end="872">Run:</p>
