ll flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="112">Install this exact version — it is the <strong data-start="39" data-end="68">best, most stable, safest</strong> for React + Vite + Tailwind + model-viewer:</p>
<hr data-start="114" data-end="117">
<h1 data-start="119" data-end="176">✅ <strong data-start="123" data-end="174">Install: Node.js 20.x LTS (Recommended Version)</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="177" data-end="204">✔ Node.js 20.11.0 LTS</h3>
<p data-start="205" data-end="255">(or <strong data-start="209" data-end="236">any Node 20 LTS version</strong> shown on the site)</p>
<hr data-start="257" data-end="260">
<h1 data-start="262" data-end="302">🔗 Download it from the official link:</h1>
<p data-start="304" data-end="360">👉 <strong data-start="307" data-end="360"><a data-start="309" data-end="358" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://nodejs.org/en/download/prebuilt-installer">https://nodejs.org/en/download/prebuilt-installer<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><path d="M14.3349 13.3301V6.60645L5.47065 15.4707C5.21095 15.7304 4.78895 15.7304 4.52925 15.4707C4.26955 15.211 4.26955 14.789 4.52925 14.5293L13.3935 5.66504H6.66011C6.29284 5.66504 5.99507 5.36727 5.99507 5C5.99507 4.63273 6.29284 4.33496 6.66011 4.33496H14.9999L15.1337 4.34863C15.4369 4.41057 15.665 4.67857 15.665 5V13.3301C15.6649 13.6973 15.3672 13.9951 14.9999 13.9951C14.6327 13.9951 14.335 13.6973 14.3349 13.3301Z"></path></svg></span></a></strong></p>
<p data-start="362" data-end="373">Then click:</p>
<h3 data-start="375" data-end="411">✔ <strong data-start="381" data-end="409">Windows Installer (.msi)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="412" data-end="434">under <strong data-start="418" data-end="433">Node.js LTS</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="436" data-end="439">
<h1 data-start="441" data-end="461">⚠️ DO NOT INSTALL:</h1>
<p data-start="462" data-end="560">❌ Node 23<br data-start="471" data-end="474">
❌ Node 21<br data-start="483" data-end="486">
❌ Node 18 (old)<br data-start="501" data-end="504">
❌ ARM version<br data-start="517" data-end="520">
❌ Zip file version<br data-start="538" data-end="541">
❌ Non-LTS version</p>
<p data-start="562" data-end="585">These can cause issues.</p>
<hr data-start="587" data-end="590">
<h1 data-start="592" data-end="616">⭐ AFTER INSTALLATION</h1>
