age-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="109">Harshitha, <strong data-start="11" data-end="48">NO — do NOT install Node v25.2.0.</strong><br data-start="48" data-end="51">
That version is <strong data-start="67" data-end="79">unstable</strong>, <strong data-start="81" data-end="92">not LTS</strong>, and will cause:</p>
<p data-start="111" data-end="237">❌ Tailwind failures<br data-start="130" data-end="133">
❌ Vite compatibility errors<br data-start="160" data-end="163">
❌ AR model-viewer issues<br data-start="187" data-end="190">
❌ React build problems<br data-start="212" data-end="215">
❌ Random npm crashes</p>
<p data-start="239" data-end="306">Your project is already sensitive.<br data-start="273" data-end="276">
We need <strong data-start="284" data-end="305">maximum stability</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="308" data-end="311">
<h1 data-start="313" data-end="340">🔥 <strong data-start="318" data-end="340">INSTALL THIS ONLY:</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="342" data-end="400">🟢 <strong data-start="349" data-end="398">Node.js 20.x LTS (Recommended for Most Users)</strong></h3>
