3201f6-96c0-4e36-9cb5-23eb441b564f" data-testid="conversation-turn-92" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT said:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="323201f6-96c0-4e36-9cb5-23eb441b564f" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="122">Great, Harshitha — this is the <strong data-start="31" data-end="67">Node.js feature selection screen</strong>, and you need to <strong data-start="85" data-end="121">keep everything exactly as shown</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="124" data-end="211">✔ You do <strong data-start="133" data-end="140">NOT</strong> need to change anything.<br data-start="165" data-end="168">
✔ The correct options are already selected.</p>
<hr data-start="213" data-end="216">
<h1 data-start="218" data-end="260">✅ <strong data-start="222" data-end="260">THESE OPTIONS MUST REMAIN CHECKED:</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="262" data-end="285">✔ Node.js runtime</h3>
<h3 data-start="286" data-end="310">✔ corepack manager</h3>
<h3 data-start="311" data-end="338">✔ npm package manager</h3>
<h3 data-start="339" data-end="358">✔ Add to PATH</h3>
<h3 data-start="359" data-end="422">✔ Online documentation shortcuts (optional but recommended)</h3>
<p data-start="424" data-end="445">Together they ensure:</p>
<ul data-start="447" data-end="581">
<li data-start="447" data-end="470">
<p data-start="449" data-end="470">Node works properly</p>
</li>
<li data-start="471" data-end="492">
<p data-start="473" data-end="492">npm work properly</p>
</li>
<li data-start="493" data-end="530">
<p data-start="495" data-end="530">npx works (required for Tailwind)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="531" data-end="581">
<p data-start="533" data-end="581">Your system PATH gets configured automatically</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="583" data-end="586">
<h1 data-start="588" data-end="615">⭐ WHAT YOU NEED TO DO NOW</h1>
<p data-start="617" data-end="700">👉 Just click <strong data-start="631" data-end="639">Next</strong><br data-start="639" data-end="642">
👉 Then <strong data-start="650" data-end="661">Install</strong><br data-start="661" data-end="664">
👉 Wait for installation to finish</p>
<hr data-start="702" data-end="705">
<h1 data-start="707" data-end="740">🚨 IMPORTANT AFTER INSTALLATION</h1>
<p data-start="742" data-end="774">Open a <strong data-start="749" data-end="765">new terminal</strong> and run:</p>
