<p data-start="807" data-end="837">📸 <strong data-start="810" data-end="837">Send me the screenshot.</strong></p>
<p data-start="839" data-end="952">If all three show version numbers, then Node is installed correctly, and Tailwind installation will finally work.</p>
<hr data-start="954" data-end="957">
