<p data-start="626" data-end="648">📸 <strong data-start="629" data-end="648">Send screenshot</strong></p>
<hr data-start="650" data-end="653">
<p data-start="655" data-end="719">If Node still does not work after restart →<br data-start="698" data-end="701">
then we do STEP 2.</p>
<hr data-start="721" data-end="724">
