hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="93">Perfect, Harshitha 👍<br data-start="21" data-end="24">
Go ahead and restart your laptop now — that is the correct next step.</p>
<p data-start="95" data-end="112">After restarting:</p>
<p data-start="114" data-end="173">1️⃣ Open a <strong data-start="125" data-end="141">new terminal</strong><br data-start="141" data-end="144">
