<p data-start="206" data-end="249">3️⃣ Send me a <strong data-start="220" data-end="234">screenshot</strong> of the output.</p>
<p data-start="251" data-end="289">Once Node is working correctly, we’ll:</p>
<p data-start="291" data-end="415">✅ Install Tailwind properly<br data-start="318" data-end="321">
