<hr data-start="566" data-end="569">
<h1 data-start="571" data-end="609">📸 <strong data-start="576" data-end="607">AFTER RUNNING BOTH COMMANDS</strong></h1>
<p data-start="610" data-end="662">Please send me a screenshot of your terminal output.</p>
<hr data-start="664" data-end="667">
<p data-start="669" data-end="711">Once Tailwind is correctly set up, I will:</p>
<p data-start="713" data-end="892">✨ Fix your UI<br data-start="726" data-end="729">
✨ Add enhanced AYUSH sections<br data-start="758" data-end="761">
✨ Add 3D &amp; AR viewer<br data-start="781" data-end="784">
✨ Add quiz<br data-start="794" data-end="797">
✨ Add beautiful cards<br data-start="818" data-end="821">
✨ Add animations<br data-start="837" data-end="840">
