s whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="57">Perfect, Harshitha —<br data-start="20" data-end="23">
Now the problem is <strong data-start="42" data-end="56">100% clear</strong>:</p>
<h3 data-start="59" data-end="94">✔ <code data-start="65" data-end="85">tailwind.config.js</code> exists</h3>
<h3 data-start="95" data-end="137">❌ <code data-start="101" data-end="120">postcss.config.js</code> does NOT exist</h3>
<p data-start="139" data-end="233">Without <strong data-start="147" data-end="168">postcss.config.js</strong>, Tailwind <strong data-start="179" data-end="196">WILL NOT WORK</strong>, even if everything else is correct.</p>
<p data-start="235" data-end="273">This is why your UI still looks plain.</p>
<p data-start="275" data-end="360">But don’t worry — this is VERY EASY to fix.<br data-start="318" data-end="321">
We’ll create the missing file manually.</p>
<hr data-start="362" data-end="365">
<h1 data-start="367" data-end="409">🌟 <strong data-start="372" data-end="409">STEP 1 — CREATE postcss.config.js</strong></h1>
<p data-start="411" data-end="422">In VS Code:</p>
<p data-start="424" data-end="513">1️⃣ Right-click on <strong data-start="443" data-end="453">client</strong> folder<br data-start="460" data-end="463">
2️⃣ Select <strong data-start="474" data-end="486">New File</strong><br data-start="486" data-end="489">
