<p data-start="180" data-end="191">This means:</p>
<h1 data-start="193" data-end="225">❗ Your Tailwind is installed</h1>
<p data-start="226" data-end="231">BUT</p>
<h1 data-start="232" data-end="276">❗ You are using the NEW Tailwind v4 syntax</h1>
<p data-start="278" data-end="337">And your project is using the <strong data-start="308" data-end="322">old syntax</strong> (Tailwind v3).</p>
<p data-start="339" data-end="412">You installed Tailwind <strong data-start="362" data-end="385">automatically as v4</strong>, which changed everything.</p>
<hr data-start="414" data-end="417">
<h1 data-start="419" data-end="447">✅ <strong data-start="423" data-end="447">Two Ways to Fix This</strong></h1>
<h2 data-start="449" data-end="480"><strong data-start="452" data-end="478">OPTION A (Recommended)</strong></h2>
<p data-start="481" data-end="545">🌟 Install Tailwind v3 (stable, compatible with your UI, easier)</p>
<h2 data-start="547" data-end="564"><strong data-start="550" data-end="562">OPTION B</strong></h2>
<p data-start="565" data-end="634">Use Tailwind v4 syntax (harder, new syntax, needs changes everywhere)</p>
<hr data-start="636" data-end="639">
<h1 data-start="641" data-end="691">⭐ YOU SHOULD DO OPTION A → Install Tailwind v3</h1>
<p data-start="692" data-end="716">This will instantly fix:</p>
<p data-start="718" data-end="814">✔ bg-green-50<br data-start="731" data-end="734">
✔ text-red-500<br data-start="748" data-end="751">
