ds whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="151">Yes Harshitha — we can <strong data-start="23" data-end="66">start working on your project RIGHT NOW</strong>,<br data-start="67" data-end="70">
<strong data-start="70" data-end="119">BUT before we build the full premium frontend</strong>, we must fix <strong data-start="133" data-end="150">ONE LAST STEP</strong>:</p>
<p data-start="153" data-end="292">👉 <strong data-start="156" data-end="199">TailwindCSS must be installed correctly</strong>, otherwise the entire UI will stay broken (no colors, no layout, no cards, no quiz styling).</p>
<p data-start="294" data-end="322">You already saw errors like:</p>
