<p data-start="382" data-end="545">This means <strong data-start="393" data-end="435">Tailwind v4 got installed accidentally</strong>, but your project is using <strong data-start="463" data-end="485">Tailwind v3 syntax</strong>.<br data-start="486" data-end="489">
So we MUST fix Tailwind FIRST — it takes only 2 minutes.</p>
<p data-start="547" data-end="674">Once Tailwind works, I will immediately continue with the <strong data-start="605" data-end="622">full UI build</strong> you requested (AYUSH sections, 3D, AR, quiz, etc.).</p>
<hr data-start="676" data-end="679">
