14269 15.8555L4.14171 15.8574H4.14464L6.5382 15.458L7.25499 15.332C7.424 15.2977 7.5394 15.2669 7.64953 15.2266L7.80285 15.165C7.95455 15.0986 8.09947 15.0174 8.23644 14.9238L8.3839 14.8135C8.53668 14.6876 8.72225 14.5035 9.0714 14.1543L14.0587 9.16602L10.8331 5.94044L5.84581 10.9287ZM15.3634 4.63673C14.5281 3.80141 13.2057 3.74938 12.3097 4.48048L12.1368 4.63673L11.7735 5.00001L15.0001 8.22559L15.3634 7.86329L15.5196 7.68946C16.2015 6.85326 16.2015 5.64676 15.5196 4.81056L15.3634 4.63673Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="39f3b4e8-fcd4-4152-9e0e-d93a34a07f10" data-testid="conversation-turn-120" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT said:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="f4052dac-2dc8-4491-a512-071d01a43890" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-t-mini"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="252">Perfect — I’ll walk you through the whole frontend <strong data-start="51" data-end="74">one piece at a time</strong>, with clear steps you can follow and learn from. We’ll build the project in small, testable chunks so you understand what each file does and can show progress to your examiners.</p>
<p data-start="254" data-end="313">We’ll follow this ordered plan (you approved “one by one”):</p>
<ol data-start="315" data-end="775">
<li data-start="315" data-end="389">
<p data-start="318" data-end="389">Main Homepage (Hero + AYUSH section selector) — <strong data-start="366" data-end="387">we’ll do this now</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="390" data-end="438">
<p data-start="393" data-end="438">AYUSH Section Pages (zone listing + search)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="439" data-end="470">
<p data-start="442" data-end="470">Plant cards + favorites UI</p>
</li>
<li data-start="471" data-end="520">
<p data-start="474" data-end="520">Plant Detail Modal (model-viewer AR + audio)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="521" data-end="567">
<p data-start="524" data-end="567">3D Garden Viewer page (React Three Fiber)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="568" data-end="613">
<p data-start="571" data-end="613">Quiz page (dynamic quiz from plant data)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="614" data-end="696">
<p data-start="617" data-end="696">Routing, state &amp; persistence (favorites in localStorage; prepare for backend)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="697" data-end="775">
<p data-start="700" data-end="775">Polish: accessibility, animations, Lighthouse checks, README &amp; report notes</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="777" data-end="925">I will provide: files to create, exact code, where to paste, commands to run, and how to test. After you confirm Part 1 works, we’ll move to Part 2.</p>
<hr data-start="927" data-end="930">
<h1 data-start="932" data-end="988">PART A — Main Homepage (Hero + AYUSH Section Selector)</h1>
<p data-start="990" data-end="1179">Goal: create a polished homepage with a hero banner and big buttons for the five AYUSH zones. This page will link to zone routes (we’ll implement those next). We’ll also wire up the Navbar.</p>
<h2 data-start="1181" data-end="1207">Files we’ll create/edit</h2>
<ul data-start="1208" data-end="1473">
<li data-start="1208" data-end="1261">
<p data-start="1210" data-end="1261"><code data-start="1210" data-end="1244">client/src/components/Navbar.jsx</code> (if not present)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1262" data-end="1304">
<p data-start="1264" data-end="1304"><code data-start="1264" data-end="1304">client/src/components/ZoneSelector.jsx</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1305" data-end="1338">
<p data-start="1307" data-end="1338"><code data-start="1307" data-end="1338">client/src/pages/HomePage.jsx</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1339" data-end="1383">
<p data-start="1341" data-end="1383"><code data-start="1341" data-end="1361">client/src/App.jsx</code> (wire homepage route)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1384" data-end="1473">
<p data-start="1386" data-end="1473"><code data-start="1386" data-end="1413">client/src/data/plants.js</code> (small seed — if not present; otherwise keep your existing)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start="1475" data-end="1590">
<p data-start="1477" data-end="1590">You probably already have many of these from earlier steps; I’ll provide the code so you can replace or paste in.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="1592" data-end="1595">
<h2 data-start="1597" data-end="1613">1) Navbar.jsx</h2>
<p data-start="1615" data-end="1670">Create (or replace) <code data-start="1635" data-end="1669">client/src/components/Navbar.jsx</code>:</p>
