</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="9124" data-end="9184">Open browser at <code data-start="9140" data-end="9163">http://localhost:5173</code> (or as Vite prints).</p>
<p data-start="9186" data-end="9196"><strong data-start="9186" data-end="9196">Check:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="9197" data-end="9469">
<li data-start="9197" data-end="9237">
<p data-start="9199" data-end="9237">Hero shows (big heading + description)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9238" data-end="9372">
<p data-start="9240" data-end="9372">Zone buttons visible and clickable — they should open a route path such as <code data-start="9315" data-end="9331">/zone/Ayurveda</code> (the stub shows “Zone page coming next”)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9373" data-end="9441">
<p data-start="9375" data-end="9441">Featured plant tiles (images) appear on the right on large screens</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9442" data-end="9469">
<p data-start="9444" data-end="9469">Navbar visible and styled</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="9471" data-end="9498">If any of these don’t show:</p>
<ul data-start="9499" data-end="9661">
<li data-start="9499" data-end="9562">
<p data-start="9501" data-end="9562">Open browser devtools (F12) → Console → send me any red error</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9563" data-end="9661">
<p data-start="9565" data-end="9661">Confirm files saved in <code data-start="9588" data-end="9604">client/src/...</code> and <code data-start="9609" data-end="9622">npm run dev</code> is running in <code data-start="9637" data-end="9661">D:\Main_project\client</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="9663" data-end="9666">
<h2 data-start="9668" data-end="9718">Quick Explanation — what you just added and why</h2>
<ul data-start="9719" data-end="9985">
<li data-start="9719" data-end="9772">
<p data-start="9721" data-end="9772"><code data-start="9721" data-end="9733">Navbar.jsx</code> — top navigation used across all pages</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9773" data-end="9829">
<p data-start="9775" data-end="9829"><code data-start="9775" data-end="9793">ZoneSelector.jsx</code> — presents AYUSH sections as routes</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9830" data-end="9887">
<p data-start="9832" data-end="9887"><code data-start="9832" data-end="9846">HomePage.jsx</code> — hero area, promo text, featured plants</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9888" data-end="9932">
<p data-start="9890" data-end="9932"><code data-start="9890" data-end="9899">App.jsx</code> — routing shell connecting pages</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9933" data-end="9985">
<p data-start="9935" data-end="9985"><code data-start="9935" data-end="9943">PLANTS</code> seed — initial dataset used by components</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="9987" data-end="10083">This sets the project skeleton. You now have a working homepage and links to the AYUSH sections.</p>
<hr data-start="10085" data-end="10088">
<p data-start="10090" data-end="10193">When you confirm Part A is working (tell me what you see or paste any console errors), I’ll proceed to:</p>
<p data-start="10195" data-end="10489"><strong data-start="10195" data-end="10227">Part B — AYUSH Section Pages</strong>:<br data-start="10228" data-end="10231">
I’ll create the full <code data-start="10252" data-end="10262">ZonePage</code> that shows filtered plant cards, search/filter controls, and connect to PlantDetailModal (we’ll build the modal in Part C). I’ll also include step-by-step explanations for React patterns (props, state, useEffect, memoization).</p>
<p data-start="10491" data-end="10588" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Which: do you want me to generate Part B next? (I’ll start as soon as you say <strong data-start="10569" data-end="10587">“Yes — Part B”</strong>)</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3