<p data-start="2016" data-end="2079">➡️ After adding these, Yoga &amp; Naturopathy page will work fully.</p>
<hr data-start="2081" data-end="2084">
<h1 data-start="2086" data-end="2125">✅ <strong data-start="2090" data-end="2125">FIX 2 — "Quiz page coming soon"</strong></h1>
<p data-start="2127" data-end="2188">That is also correct, because you have not added Quiz UI yet.</p>
<p data-start="2190" data-end="2364">We will build the <strong data-start="2208" data-end="2238">full quiz system in Part F</strong> — but before that<br data-start="2256" data-end="2259">
we must complete <strong data-start="2276" data-end="2307">Part C (Plant Detail Modal)</strong> and <strong data-start="2312" data-end="2334">Part D (Favorites)</strong> because Quiz uses plant data.</p>
<hr data-start="2366" data-end="2369">
<h1 data-start="2371" data-end="2418">👉 NEXT: Add Full Plant Detail Modal (Part C)</h1>
<p data-start="2420" data-end="2474">This is the MOST IMPORTANT feature for your 200 marks.</p>
<p data-start="2476" data-end="2488">It includes:</p>
<h3 data-start="2490" data-end="2510">🌿 Plant Image</h3>
<h3 data-start="2511" data-end="2544">🧬 Scientific Name &amp; Family</h3>
<h3 data-start="2545" data-end="2558">🧠 Uses</h3>
<h3 data-start="2559" data-end="2579">📝 Description</h3>
<h3 data-start="2580" data-end="2604">⭐ Add to Favorites</h3>
<h3 data-start="2605" data-end="2629">🌀 3D Model Viewer</h3>
<h3 data-start="2630" data-end="2648">📱 AR Button</h3>
<h3 data-start="2649" data-end="2673">🎧 Audio Narration</h3>
<h3 data-start="2674" data-end="2694">❌ Close Button</h3>
<hr data-start="2696" data-end="2699">
<h1 data-start="2701" data-end="2752">💬 Harshitha, do you want me to proceed now with:</h1>
<h3 data-start="2754" data-end="2821"><strong data-start="2758" data-end="2819">👉 Part C: Full Plant Detail Modal (with 3D + AR + Audio)</strong> ?</h3>
