flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="94">Perfect, Harshitha! 🎉<br data-start="22" data-end="25">
Now that your <strong data-start="39" data-end="61">plants.js is fixed</strong> and your UI is working properly…</p>
<h1 data-start="96" data-end="137">🎯 <strong data-start="101" data-end="135">We are ready for the NEXT STEP</strong></h1>
<p data-start="138" data-end="246">We are building your <strong data-start="159" data-end="208">full 200-marks Virtual Herbal Garden frontend</strong> step-by-step so you learn everything.</p>
<p data-start="248" data-end="270">You already completed:</p>
<p data-start="272" data-end="404">✔ Step 1 — Home UI<br data-start="290" data-end="293">
✔ Step 2 — Navigation<br data-start="314" data-end="317">
✔ Step 3 — Tailwind setup<br data-start="342" data-end="345">
✔ Step 4 — Plant cards working<br data-start="375" data-end="378">
✔ Step 5 — Routing working</p>
<p data-start="406" data-end="421">Now we move to:</p>
<hr data-start="423" data-end="426">
<h1 data-start="428" data-end="496">🌿 <strong data-start="433" data-end="494">STEP 6 — Build AYUSH Zone Pages (Advanced UI + Filtering)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="497" data-end="546">These pages will show <strong data-start="519" data-end="545">plants for each system</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="548" data-end="619">
<li data-start="548" data-end="560">
<p data-start="550" data-end="560">Ayurveda</p>
</li>
<li data-start="561" data-end="583">
<p data-start="563" data-end="583">Yoga &amp; Naturopathy</p>
</li>
<li data-start="584" data-end="593">
<p data-start="586" data-end="593">Unani</p>
</li>
<li data-start="594" data-end="604">
<p data-start="596" data-end="604">Siddha</p>
</li>
<li data-start="605" data-end="619">
<p data-start="607" data-end="619">Homeopathy</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="621" data-end="784">⚡ These pages must NOT be empty anymore.<br data-start="661" data-end="664">
⚡ They will include plant listing, filtering, and descriptions.<br data-start="727" data-end="730">
⚡ This section adds MASSIVE weightage to your project.</p>
<hr data-start="786" data-end="789">
<h1 data-start="791" data-end="833">✅ First, choose your next page to build:</h1>
<h3 data-start="835" data-end="882"><strong data-start="839" data-end="882">Which AYUSH Page should we build first?</strong></h3>
<p data-start="884" data-end="906">Choose <strong data-start="891" data-end="905">one option</strong>:</p>
<h3 data-start="908" data-end="946">🌿 Option A — Ayurveda Zone Page</h3>
<h3 data-start="947" data-end="995">🌿 Option B — Yoga &amp; Naturopathy Zone Page</h3>
<h3 data-start="996" data-end="1031">🌿 Option C — Unani Zone Page</h3>
<h3 data-start="1032" data-end="1068">🌿 Option D — Siddha Zone Page</h3>
<h3 data-start="1069" data-end="1109">🌿 Option E — Homeopathy Zone Page</h3>
<h3 data-start="1110" data-end="1159">🌿 Option F — Build all 5 zone pages together</h3>
<hr data-start="1161" data-end="1164">
<h1 data-start="1166" data-end="1208">⭐ My recommendation for you (for marks):</h1>
<p data-start="1210" data-end="1288">👉 <strong data-start="1213" data-end="1266">Choose Option F — Build all 5 zone pages together</strong><br data-start="1266" data-end="1269">
This will give you:</p>
<p data-start="1290" data-end="1455">✔ Beautiful UI<br data-start="1304" data-end="1307">
✔ Filtering<br data-start="1318" data-end="1321">
✔ Dedicated plant lists<br data-start="1344" data-end="1347">
✔ Ayurvedic intro sections<br data-start="1373" data-end="1376">
✔ System-wise color theme<br data-start="1401" data-end="1404">
✔ Professional design<br data-start="1425" data-end="1428">
✔ Excellent project depth</p>
<hr data-start="1457" data-end="1460">
<h1 data-start="1462" data-end="1518">👉 Harshitha, tell me: <strong data-start="1487" data-end="1516">which option do you want?</strong></h1>
<p data-start="1519" data-end="1530">Just reply:</p>
<p data-start="1532" data-end="1575">✔ <strong data-start="1534" data-end="1539">A</strong>, or<br data-start="1543" data-end="1546">
✔ <strong data-start="1548" data-end="1553">B</strong>, or<br data-start="1557" data-end="1560">
✔ <strong data-start="1562" data-end="1575">F — All 5</strong></p>
