s="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="176">GREAT choice, Harshitha! 🌿🔥<br data-start="29" data-end="32">
<strong data-start="32" data-end="75">Option F (Build ALL 5 AYUSH Zone Pages)</strong> will give your project <strong data-start="99" data-end="116">maximum marks</strong>, because examiners LOVE when each AYUSH system has its own:</p>
<p data-start="178" data-end="285">✔ Dedicated UI<br data-start="192" data-end="195">
✔ System-specific description<br data-start="224" data-end="227">
✔ List of plants<br data-start="243" data-end="246">
✔ Filters<br data-start="255" data-end="258">
✔ Search<br data-start="266" data-end="269">
✔ Clean layout</p>
<p data-start="287" data-end="305">We will now build:</p>
<h3 data-start="307" data-end="328">✅ Ayurveda Page</h3>
<h3 data-start="329" data-end="360">✅ Yoga &amp; Naturopathy Page</h3>
<h3 data-start="361" data-end="379">✅ Unani Page</h3>
<h3 data-start="380" data-end="399">✅ Siddha Page</h3>
<h3 data-start="400" data-end="423">✅ Homeopathy Page</h3>
<p data-start="425" data-end="493">All using <strong data-start="435" data-end="470">one powerful reusable component</strong> — your <code data-start="478" data-end="492">ZonePage.jsx</code>.</p>
<p data-start="495" data-end="540">This keeps code clean AND looks professional.</p>
<hr data-start="542" data-end="545">
<h1 data-start="547" data-end="592">🌟 STEP 1 — Add AYUSH system descriptions</h1>
<p data-start="593" data-end="641">Create file:<br data-start="605" data-end="608">
📁 <code data-start="611" data-end="641">client/src/data/ayushInfo.js</code></p>
