v class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="95">Perfect, Harshitha — now we build the <strong data-start="38" data-end="64">MOST IMPORTANT FEATURE</strong> of your Virtual Herbal Garden:</p>
<h1 data-start="97" data-end="175">🌟 <strong data-start="102" data-end="175">STEP 7 — PLANT DETAIL MODAL (with 3D + AR + Audio + Uses + Favorites)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="177" data-end="279">This single feature gives the <strong data-start="207" data-end="224">highest marks</strong> in UI, innovation, interactivity, and technical depth.</p>
<p data-start="281" data-end="348">We will build it in <strong data-start="301" data-end="323">small, clear steps</strong> so you learn everything.</p>
<hr data-start="350" data-end="353">
<h1 data-start="355" data-end="390">✅ <strong data-start="359" data-end="390">Before We Start — IMPORTANT</strong></h1>
<p data-start="391" data-end="416">Your project already has:</p>
<p data-start="418" data-end="477">✔ Homepage<br data-start="428" data-end="431">
✔ AYUSH Zones<br data-start="444" data-end="447">
✔ Plant Cards<br data-start="460" data-end="463">
✔ plant data</p>
<p data-start="479" data-end="536">But clicking a plant does <strong data-start="505" data-end="512">NOT</strong> show plant details yet.</p>
<p data-start="538" data-end="552">So now we add:</p>
<p data-start="554" data-end="778">🟢 A modal that opens when clicking a plant<br data-start="597" data-end="600">
🟢 Shows plant image<br data-start="620" data-end="623">
🟢 Shows scientific name<br data-start="647" data-end="650">
🟢 Uses / Family / Description<br data-start="680" data-end="683">
🟢 3D Model Viewer<br data-start="701" data-end="704">
🟢 AR Button<br data-start="716" data-end="719">
🟢 Audio narration<br data-start="737" data-end="740">
🟢 Add to Favorites<br data-start="759" data-end="762">
🟢 Close Modal</p>
<p data-start="780" data-end="813">This will AMAZE your faculty. 🌿✨</p>
<hr data-start="815" data-end="818">
<h1 data-start="820" data-end="855">⭐ STEP A — Create Modal Component</h1>
<p data-start="857" data-end="913">📁 Create file:<br data-start="872" data-end="875">
