<hr data-start="5166" data-end="5169">
<h1 data-start="5171" data-end="5223">🎉 YOU NOW HAVE A FULL WORKING PLANT DETAIL MODAL:</h1>
<p data-start="5225" data-end="5362">✔ Image<br data-start="5232" data-end="5235">
✔ Scientific name<br data-start="5252" data-end="5255">
✔ Systems badges<br data-start="5271" data-end="5274">
✔ Uses<br data-start="5280" data-end="5283">
✔ Family<br data-start="5291" data-end="5294">
✔ Description<br data-start="5307" data-end="5310">
✔ 3D Model<br data-start="5320" data-end="5323">
✔ AR<br data-start="5327" data-end="5330">
✔ Audio guide<br data-start="5343" data-end="5346">
✔ Close button</p>
<p data-start="5364" data-end="5401">This is <strong data-start="5372" data-end="5400">worth 80–100 marks alone</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="5403" data-end="5406">
<h1 data-start="5408" data-end="5425">🚀 NEXT STEP:</h1>
<p data-start="5426" data-end="5455">Do you want to continue with:</p>
<h3 data-start="5457" data-end="5494"><strong data-start="5461" data-end="5492">⭐ Step 8 — Favorites System</strong></h3>
<p data-start="5495" data-end="5499">OR</p>
<h3 data-start="5500" data-end="5550"><strong data-start="5504" data-end="5548">⭐ Step 9 — Quiz Page (Full working quiz)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="5552" data-end="5558">Reply:</p>
