a-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="105">Great job, Harshitha! 🌿✨<br data-start="25" data-end="28">
Since you fixed all parts of the <strong data-start="61" data-end="73">ZonePage</strong>, your next step is very simple:</p>
<hr data-start="107" data-end="110">
<h1 data-start="112" data-end="160">✅ <strong data-start="116" data-end="160">NEXT STEP — Add the Modal Component Code</strong></h1>
<p data-start="161" data-end="176">Now we need to:</p>
<h3 data-start="178" data-end="217">✔ Add the <strong data-start="192" data-end="210">PlantModal.jsx</strong> file</h3>
<h3 data-start="218" data-end="251">✔ Connect it with PlantCard</h3>
<h3 data-start="252" data-end="298">✔ Test if clicking a plant opens a modal</h3>
<p data-start="300" data-end="351">This will complete <strong data-start="319" data-end="350">STEP 7 — Plant Detail Modal</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="353" data-end="406">Let’s go step-by-step so you don’t make any mistakes.</p>
<hr data-start="408" data-end="411">
<h1 data-start="413" data-end="451">✅ <strong data-start="417" data-end="451">STEP 1 — Create PlantModal.jsx</strong></h1>
<p data-start="453" data-end="459">Go to:</p>
<p data-start="461" data-end="488">📁 <code data-start="464" data-end="488">client/src/components/</code></p>
<p data-start="490" data-end="508">Create a new file:</p>
<p data-start="510" data-end="529">📄 <code data-start="513" data-end="529">PlantModal.jsx</code></p>
