<p data-start="3617" data-end="3623">Go to:</p>
<p data-start="3625" data-end="3673">👉 Home<br data-start="3632" data-end="3635">
👉 Any AYUSH zone<br data-start="3652" data-end="3655">
👉 Click a plant</p>
<p data-start="3675" data-end="3692">You must now see:</p>
<p data-start="3694" data-end="3877">✔ A modal pops up<br data-start="3711" data-end="3714">
✔ Plant image<br data-start="3727" data-end="3730">
✔ Name + Scientific name<br data-start="3754" data-end="3757">
✔ Description<br data-start="3770" data-end="3773">
✔ Systems badges<br data-start="3789" data-end="3792">
✔ Uses + Family<br data-start="3807" data-end="3810">
✔ 3D Model viewer<br data-start="3827" data-end="3830">
✔ AR button<br data-start="3841" data-end="3844">
✔ Audio player<br data-start="3858" data-end="3861">
✔ Close button</p>
<hr data-start="3879" data-end="3882">
<h1 data-start="3884" data-end="3929">🎉 If modal opens — YOU COMPLETED STEP 7!</h1>
<p data-start="3930" data-end="3967">This earns you a huge chunk of marks.</p>
<hr data-start="3969" data-end="3972">
<h1 data-start="3974" data-end="3999">🌟 READY FOR NEXT STEP?</h1>
<p data-start="4001" data-end="4033">Would you like to continue with:</p>
<h3 data-start="4035" data-end="4068">⭐ STEP 8 — Favorites System</h3>
<p data-start="4069" data-end="4073">OR</p>
<h3 data-start="4074" data-end="4122">⭐ STEP 9 — Quiz Page (Fully functional quiz)</h3>
<p data-start="4124" data-end="4135">Just reply:</p>
<p data-start="4137" data-end="4172" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">👉 <strong data-start="4140" data-end="4153">Favorites</strong><br data-start="4153" data-end="4156">
or<br data-start="4158" data-end="4161">
