own-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="190">No worries Harshitha — I will show you <strong data-start="39" data-end="68">EXACTLY where to paste it</strong>, with a clear diagram so there is <em data-start="103" data-end="119">zero confusion</em>.<br data-start="120" data-end="123">
This is the <strong data-start="135" data-end="148">last part</strong> needed to make your modal open correctly.</p>
<hr data-start="192" data-end="195">
<h1 data-start="197" data-end="229">✅ <strong data-start="201" data-end="229">WHERE TO PLACE THIS CODE</strong></h1>
