<h1 data-start="2462" data-end="2492">⭐ If you are still confused…</h1>
<p data-start="2494" data-end="2609">👉 <strong data-start="2497" data-end="2542">Please send me your full <code data-start="2524" data-end="2540">PlantModal.jsx</code></strong>,<br data-start="2543" data-end="2546">
