<h3 data-start="1163" data-end="1181">3️⃣ Save &amp; run</h3>
<p data-start="1183" data-end="1260">If your UI <strong data-start="1194" data-end="1209">works again</strong>, then the issue is inside PlantModal or plants.js.</p>
<hr data-start="1262" data-end="1265">
<h1 data-start="1267" data-end="1305">✅ <strong data-start="1271" data-end="1305">THIRD: Check plant.model paths</strong></h1>
