.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-symbol">model:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"/models/tulsi.glb"</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1375" data-end="1395">BUT you do not have:</p>
<p data-start="1397" data-end="1469">📁 client/public/models/tulsi.glb<br data-start="1430" data-end="1433">
📁 client/public/models/tulsi.usdz</p>
<p data-start="1471" data-end="1507">Then model-viewer may crash the app.</p>
<hr data-start="1509" data-end="1512">
<h1 data-start="1514" data-end="1543">⭐ <strong data-start="1518" data-end="1541">I CAN FIX THIS FAST</strong></h1>
<p data-start="1544" data-end="1602">To fix this correctly, I need to see <strong data-start="1581" data-end="1601">the actual error</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="1604" data-end="1619">Please do this:</p>
<hr data-start="1621" data-end="1624">
<h1 data-start="1626" data-end="1685">📸 <strong data-start="1631" data-end="1685">STEP: Send me a screenshot of your browser console</strong></h1>
<p data-start="1687" data-end="1792">1️⃣ Open your UI<br data-start="1703" data-end="1706">
2️⃣ Press <strong data-start="1716" data-end="1723">F12</strong> → Developer Tools<br data-start="1741" data-end="1744">
3️⃣ Click <strong data-start="1754" data-end="1765">Console</strong><br data-start="1765" data-end="1768">
4️⃣ Share the screenshot</p>
<p data-start="1794" data-end="1802">Example:</p>
