<hr data-start="1915" data-end="1918">
<h1 data-start="1920" data-end="1988">✔️ With that screenshot, I can fix your entire UI in 1–2 messages.</h1>
<p data-start="1990" data-end="2000">Just send:</p>
<p data-start="2002" data-end="2111">👉 <strong data-start="2005" data-end="2042">a screenshot of the console error</strong>,<br data-start="2043" data-end="2046">
OR<br data-start="2048" data-end="2051">
👉 <strong data-start="2054" data-end="2111">copy-paste your ZonePage.jsx and PlantModal.jsx again</strong></p>
