d-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="6a25f520-dd73-4658-a26a-b7a9e8692c15" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="71">Harshitha, the <strong data-start="15" data-end="42">error is STILL the same</strong>, which means only one thing:</p>
<h1 data-start="73" data-end="123">🚨 <strong data-start="78" data-end="123">You STILL have model-viewer loaded twice.</strong></h1>
<p data-start="124" data-end="256">You removed it from <strong data-start="144" data-end="162">PlantModal.jsx</strong> (good)…<br data-start="170" data-end="173">
but <strong data-start="177" data-end="230">you STILL have 2 copies loading inside index.html</strong> OR <strong data-start="234" data-end="255">another component</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="258" data-end="312">Let’s fix it <strong data-start="271" data-end="283">100% now</strong>.<br data-start="284" data-end="287">
Follow these EXACT steps:</p>
<hr data-start="314" data-end="317">
<h1 data-start="319" data-end="358">✅ <strong data-start="323" data-end="358">STEP 1 — OPEN your <code data-start="344" data-end="356">index.html</code></strong></h1>
