<h1 data-start="1033" data-end="1072">✅ <strong data-start="1037" data-end="1072">STEP 3 — Check other components</strong></h1>
<p data-start="1073" data-end="1088">You must check:</p>
<p data-start="1090" data-end="1218">📁 <code data-start="1093" data-end="1122">src/components/ARViewer.jsx</code><br data-start="1122" data-end="1125">
📁 <code data-start="1128" data-end="1160">src/components/GardenScene.jsx</code><br data-start="1160" data-end="1163">
📁 <code data-start="1166" data-end="1195">src/components/ZonePage.jsx</code><br data-start="1195" data-end="1198">
📁 <code data-start="1201" data-end="1218">src/Pages/*.jsx</code></p>
