<hr data-start="1447" data-end="1450">
<h1 data-start="1452" data-end="1476">🧠 WHY THIS FIX WORKS?</h1>
<p data-start="1477" data-end="1485">Because:</p>
<p data-start="1487" data-end="1646">• Browsers do NOT allow registering the same custom element twice.<br data-start="1553" data-end="1556">
• <code data-start="1558" data-end="1574">&lt;model-viewer&gt;</code> is a custom element.<br data-start="1595" data-end="1598">
• If two scripts try to “define” it → <strong data-start="1636" data-end="1645">CRASH</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1648" data-end="1651">
<h1 data-start="1653" data-end="1699">🤖 If you want, I can FIX IT automatically</h1>
<p data-start="1700" data-end="1713">Just send me:</p>
<p data-start="1715" data-end="1823">📌 <strong data-start="1718" data-end="1742">your index.html code</strong><br data-start="1742" data-end="1745">
📌 <strong data-start="1748" data-end="1776">your PlantModal.jsx code</strong><br data-start="1776" data-end="1779">
📌 <strong data-start="1782" data-end="1823">your src/components folder screenshot</strong></p>
<p data-start="1825" data-end="1868">I will check where the duplicate script is.</p>
<hr data-start="1870" data-end="1873">
<h1 data-start="1875" data-end="1910">🌿 Want to continue after fixing?</h1>
<p data-start="1911" data-end="1919">Tell me:</p>
