1057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">Failed</span></span><span> to execute </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'define'</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-literal">on</span></span><span> CustomElementRegistry:
the name </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"model-viewer"</span></span><span> has already been used
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="299" data-end="363">This <strong data-start="304" data-end="362">ONLY happens when <code data-start="324" data-end="340">&lt;model-viewer&gt;</code> is registered twice</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="365" data-end="444">So the second registration is happening in <strong data-start="408" data-end="427">your React code</strong>, not index.html.</p>
<hr data-start="446" data-end="449">
<h1 data-start="451" data-end="508">✅ NOW WE MUST FIND WHERE THE DUPLICATE IS COMING FROM</h1>
<p data-start="509" data-end="535">Please do this EXACT step:</p>
<hr data-start="537" data-end="540">
<h1 data-start="542" data-end="586">🔍 <strong data-start="547" data-end="586">STEP 1 — Search your entire project</strong></h1>
<p data-start="587" data-end="598">In VS Code:</p>
<h3 data-start="600" data-end="632">Press <strong data-start="610" data-end="630">Ctrl + Shift + F</strong></h3>
