new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="157">Perfect — your <strong data-start="15" data-end="40">index.html is correct</strong>.<br data-start="41" data-end="44">
There is <strong data-start="53" data-end="85">only ONE model-viewer script</strong>, so the duplicate must be coming from <strong data-start="124" data-end="156">inside your React components</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="159" data-end="206">Let’s now find and delete the duplicate import.</p>
