<p data-start="1225" data-end="1231">Means:</p>
<ul data-start="1232" data-end="1376">
<li data-start="1232" data-end="1282">
<p data-start="1234" data-end="1282">Browser tries to register <code data-start="1260" data-end="1276">&lt;model-viewer&gt;</code> twice</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1283" data-end="1326">
<p data-start="1285" data-end="1326">First registration = index.html (correct)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1327" data-end="1376">
<p data-start="1329" data-end="1376">Second registration = inside React code (wrong)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1378" data-end="1408">We must remove the second one.</p>
<hr data-start="1410" data-end="1413">
