><p data-start="0" data-end="164">Great — thank you, Harshitha!<br data-start="29" data-end="32">
<strong data-start="32" data-end="65">This file is NOT the problem.</strong><br data-start="65" data-end="68">
<code data-start="68" data-end="82">ARViewer.jsx</code> is fine. It correctly uses <code data-start="110" data-end="126">&lt;model-viewer&gt;</code> WITHOUT importing model-viewer again.</p>
<p data-start="166" data-end="219">The real issue is still coming from <strong data-start="202" data-end="218">another file</strong>.</p>
