<p data-start="1015" data-end="1118">Now your <strong data-start="1024" data-end="1070">model-viewer duplicate error will be fixed</strong> and your <strong data-start="1080" data-end="1118">3D model + AR will load correctly.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1120" data-end="1123">
<h1 data-start="1125" data-end="1191">📸 If you want, send me a screenshot of your folder structure,</h1>
<p data-start="1192" data-end="1242">so I can confirm the file is in the correct place.</p>
