</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="702" data-end="735">You should see results like this:</p>
<ul data-start="737" data-end="786">
<li data-start="737" data-end="759">
<p data-start="739" data-end="759">index.html (correct)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="760" data-end="786">
<p data-start="762" data-end="786">❌ any React file = WRONG</p>
</li>
</ul>
