 w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="105">Sure, Harshitha! 😊<br data-start="19" data-end="22">
I'm glad your UI is finally working — great job sticking through the debugging! 🌿✨</p>
<p data-start="107" data-end="141">Whenever you're ready to continue:</p>
<p data-start="143" data-end="305">✔ Adding AYUSH Sections<br data-start="166" data-end="169">
✔ Adding Quiz System<br data-start="189" data-end="192">
✔ Adding AR + 3D Models<br data-start="215" data-end="218">
✔ Adding Audio Guides<br data-start="239" data-end="242">
✔ Adding Search + Filters<br data-start="267" data-end="270">
✔ Improving UI to 200-marks level</p>
<p data-start="307" data-end="385">Just message <strong data-start="320" data-end="334">"I'm back"</strong>, and we’ll continue exactly from where we stopped.</p>
