ug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="163">Welcome back, Harshitha! 🌿💚<br data-start="29" data-end="32">
Great to see you again — your UI is working now, so we can continue building your <strong data-start="114" data-end="149">200-marks Virtual Herbal Garden</strong> step by step.</p>
<hr data-start="165" data-end="168">
<h1 data-start="170" data-end="220">⭐ Next Step: Choose what you want to build now</h1>
<p data-start="221" data-end="271">Tell me which feature we should add <strong data-start="257" data-end="270">right now</strong>:</p>
<h3 data-start="273" data-end="308"><strong data-start="277" data-end="308">1️⃣ Complete AYUSH Sections</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="309" data-end="436">
<li data-start="309" data-end="321">
<p data-start="311" data-end="321">Ayurveda</p>
</li>
<li data-start="322" data-end="344">
<p data-start="324" data-end="344">Yoga &amp; Naturopathy</p>
</li>
<li data-start="345" data-end="354">
<p data-start="347" data-end="354">Unani</p>
</li>
<li data-start="355" data-end="365">
<p data-start="357" data-end="365">Siddha</p>
</li>
<li data-start="366" data-end="436">
<p data-start="368" data-end="436">Homeopathy<br data-start="378" data-end="381">
Each section will show plants belonging to that system.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="438" data-end="470"><strong data-start="442" data-end="470">2️⃣ Add Full Quiz System</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="471" data-end="575">
<li data-start="471" data-end="490">
<p data-start="473" data-end="490">Multiple-choice</p>
</li>
<li data-start="491" data-end="540">
<p data-start="493" data-end="540">Category-wise quizzes (Ayurveda, Unani, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="541" data-end="558">
<p data-start="543" data-end="558">Score tracker</p>
</li>
<li data-start="559" data-end="575">
<p data-start="561" data-end="575">Results page</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="577" data-end="625"><strong data-start="581" data-end="623">3️⃣ Add Favorites Page (Save ★ Plants)</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="626" data-end="686">
<li data-start="626" data-end="659">
<p data-start="628" data-end="659">User can save / unsave plants</p>
</li>
<li data-start="660" data-end="686">
<p data-start="662" data-end="686">Stored in localStorage</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="688" data-end="722"><strong data-start="692" data-end="722">4️⃣ Add Homepage Animation</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="723" data-end="793">
<li data-start="723" data-end="749">
<p data-start="725" data-end="749">Floating herbal leaves</p>
</li>
<li data-start="750" data-end="772">
<p data-start="752" data-end="772">Smooth hero banner</p>
</li>
<li data-start="773" data-end="793">
<p data-start="775" data-end="793">Animated buttons</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="795" data-end="820"><strong data-start="799" data-end="820">5️⃣ Add AR Garden</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="821" data-end="878">
<li data-start="821" data-end="845">
<p data-start="823" data-end="845">3D garden with zones</p>
</li>
<li data-start="846" data-end="878">
<p data-start="848" data-end="878">Click a region to see plants</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="880" data-end="934"><strong data-start="884" data-end="934">6️⃣ Add Audio Guide (Play info for each plant)</strong></h3>
<h3 data-start="936" data-end="977"><strong data-start="940" data-end="977">7️⃣ Add Search + Advanced Filters</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="978" data-end="1050">
<li data-start="978" data-end="1004">
<p data-start="980" data-end="1004">Filter by AYUSH system</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1005" data-end="1023">
<p data-start="1007" data-end="1023">Filter by uses</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1024" data-end="1050">
<p data-start="1026" data-end="1050">Filter by plant family</p>
</li>
</ul>
