><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="116">Great! Since this is a <strong data-start="23" data-end="50">200-marks major project</strong>, the next most valuable and impressive feature you should add is:</p>
<h1 data-start="118" data-end="169">⭐ <strong data-start="122" data-end="167">Option 1 — Complete AYUSH System Sections</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="170" data-end="231">(Ayurveda, Yoga &amp; Naturopathy, Unani, Siddha, Homeopathy)</h3>
<p data-start="233" data-end="270">This is <strong data-start="241" data-end="261">HIGHLY important</strong> because:</p>
<p data-start="272" data-end="474">✔ It matches EXACTLY your project title<br data-start="311" data-end="314">
✔ Reviewers expect AYUSH categories<br data-start="349" data-end="352">
✔ Makes UI look professional and organized<br data-start="394" data-end="397">
✔ Boosts marks immediately<br data-start="423" data-end="426">
✔ Easy to extend later with quizzes, 3D, audio</p>
<p data-start="476" data-end="521">So YES — we will add <strong data-start="497" data-end="515">AYUSH Sections</strong> next.</p>
<hr data-start="523" data-end="526">
<h1 data-start="528" data-end="564">⭐ What This Feature Will Include</h1>
<p data-start="565" data-end="580">We will create:</p>
<h3 data-start="582" data-end="616">1️⃣ <strong data-start="590" data-end="605">A new page:</strong> <code data-start="606" data-end="614">/ayush</code></h3>
<h3 data-start="617" data-end="650">2️⃣ <strong data-start="625" data-end="650">Five clickable cards:</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="651" data-end="722">
<li data-start="651" data-end="663">
<p data-start="653" data-end="663">Ayurveda</p>
</li>
<li data-start="664" data-end="686">
<p data-start="666" data-end="686">Yoga &amp; Naturopathy</p>
</li>
<li data-start="687" data-end="696">
<p data-start="689" data-end="696">Unani</p>
</li>
<li data-start="697" data-end="707">
<p data-start="699" data-end="707">Siddha</p>
</li>
<li data-start="708" data-end="722">
<p data-start="710" data-end="722">Homeopathy</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="724" data-end="785">3️⃣ <strong data-start="732" data-end="783">Each card opens a plant list filtered by system</strong></h3>
<p data-start="786" data-end="881">Example:<br data-start="794" data-end="797">
Ayurveda → shows Tulsi, Neem, Ashwagandha, etc.<br data-start="844" data-end="847">
Unani → shows Aloe, Licorice, etc.</p>
<h3 data-start="883" data-end="933">4️⃣ <strong data-start="891" data-end="931">Includes beautiful UI using Tailwind</strong></h3>
<h3 data-start="934" data-end="991">5️⃣ <strong data-start="942" data-end="989">Integrated with your PlantModal (3D viewer)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="993" data-end="1046">This makes your project look BIG and WELL-STRUCTURED.</p>
<hr data-start="1048" data-end="1051">
