<h1 data-start="3676" data-end="3690">🌿 FINISHED!</h1>
<p data-start="3691" data-end="3704">Now you have:</p>
<p data-start="3706" data-end="3854">✔ Beautiful AYUSH menu<br data-start="3728" data-end="3731">
✔ Each AYUSH system opens its own plant category<br data-start="3779" data-end="3782">
✔ Works perfectly with your PlantModal<br data-start="3820" data-end="3823">
✔ Very high weightage feature</p>
<hr data-start="3856" data-end="3859">
<h1 data-start="3861" data-end="3887">🎉 NEXT IMPORTANT STEP</h1>
