<p data-start="222" data-end="255">This will break React completely.</p>
<hr data-start="257" data-end="260">
<h1 data-start="262" data-end="311">✅ <strong data-start="266" data-end="311">You must keep ONLY ONE HomePage component</strong></h1>
<p data-start="312" data-end="390">Since we want <strong data-start="326" data-end="352">plant clicking support</strong>, the correct version is the one with:</p>
