t markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="147">Yes, Harshitha — <strong data-start="17" data-end="56">your PlantModal.jsx code is correct</strong>, and it will work <strong data-start="75" data-end="88">perfectly</strong> <em data-start="89" data-end="146">as long as your index.html loads model-viewer only once</em>.</p>
<p data-start="149" data-end="181">Let me check every part for you:</p>
<hr data-start="183" data-end="186">
<h1 data-start="188" data-end="228">✅ <strong data-start="192" data-end="228">1. Component structure = CORRECT</strong></h1>
<p data-start="229" data-end="386">✔ Accepts <code data-start="239" data-end="246">plant</code><br data-start="246" data-end="249">
✔ Accepts <code data-start="259" data-end="268">onClose</code><br data-start="268" data-end="271">
✔ Checks <code data-start="280" data-end="305">if (!plant) return null</code> (good!)<br data-start="313" data-end="316">
✔ Wrapper modal container is correct<br data-start="352" data-end="355">
✔ Close button works properly</p>
<hr data-start="388" data-end="391">
<h1 data-start="393" data-end="435">✅ <strong data-start="397" data-end="435">2. Plant details section = CORRECT</strong></h1>
<p data-start="436" data-end="521">✔ Name<br data-start="442" data-end="445">
✔ Scientific name<br data-start="462" data-end="465">
✔ Systems (badges)<br data-start="483" data-end="486">
✔ Description<br data-start="499" data-end="502">
✔ Family<br data-start="510" data-end="513">
✔ Uses</p>
<p data-start="523" data-end="532">All good.</p>
<hr data-start="534" data-end="537">
<h1 data-start="539" data-end="575">✅ <strong data-start="543" data-end="575">3. 3D Model Viewer = CORRECT</strong></h1>
<p data-start="576" data-end="590">You are using:</p>
