:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="123">Since your project must score <strong data-start="30" data-end="43">200 marks</strong>, the next most <strong data-start="59" data-end="71">valuable</strong>, <strong data-start="73" data-end="84">scoring</strong>, and <strong data-start="90" data-end="104">impressive</strong> feature to add is:</p>
<h1 data-start="125" data-end="151">⭐ <strong data-start="129" data-end="151">AYUSH System Pages</strong></h1>
<p data-start="152" data-end="209">(Ayurveda, Yoga &amp; Naturopathy, Unani, Siddha, Homeopathy)</p>
<h3 data-start="211" data-end="248">✔ Why this is the BEST next step?</h3>
<p data-start="249" data-end="257">Because:</p>
<h3 data-start="259" data-end="299">⭐ 1. It matches your project title</h3>
<p data-start="300" data-end="348">“Virtual Herbal Garden showcasing AYUSH systems”</p>
<h3 data-start="350" data-end="404">⭐ 2. Teachers look for AYUSH category separation</h3>
<p data-start="405" data-end="454">To check that you covered all 5 systems properly.</p>
<h3 data-start="456" data-end="517">⭐ 3. It makes your project feel BIG and well-structured</h3>
<p data-start="518" data-end="558">One click → entire plant category opens.</p>
<h3 data-start="560" data-end="595">⭐ 4. It prepares the base for</h3>
<ul data-start="596" data-end="694">
<li data-start="596" data-end="616">
<p data-start="598" data-end="616">System-wise quiz</p>
</li>
<li data-start="617" data-end="646">
<p data-start="619" data-end="646">System-wise learning path</p>
</li>
<li data-start="647" data-end="665">
<p data-start="649" data-end="665">System-wise AR</p>
</li>
<li data-start="666" data-end="694">
<p data-start="668" data-end="694">System-wise audio guides</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="696" data-end="732">⭐ 5. Simple to add, HUGE impact.</h3>
<hr data-start="734" data-end="737">
<h1 data-start="739" data-end="775">🎯 <strong data-start="744" data-end="773">So the best next step is:</strong></h1>
<h1 data-start="776" data-end="829">✅ <strong data-start="780" data-end="829">Build AYUSH System Dashboard + Category Pages</strong></h1>
<hr data-start="831" data-end="834">
<h1 data-start="836" data-end="875">⭐ After that, next recommended order:</h1>
<h3 data-start="877" data-end="910">1️⃣ AYUSH Pages (we do now)</h3>
<h3 data-start="911" data-end="948">2️⃣ Quiz System (major scoring)</h3>
<h3 data-start="949" data-end="973">3️⃣ Favorites Page</h3>
<h3 data-start="974" data-end="999">4️⃣ Search + Filter</h3>
<h3 data-start="1000" data-end="1019">5️⃣ AR Garden</h3>
<h3 data-start="1020" data-end="1042">6️⃣ Audio Guides</h3>
<h3 data-start="1043" data-end="1069">7️⃣ Homepage Animation</h3>
<p data-start="1071" data-end="1148">This order builds your project from <strong data-start="1107" data-end="1147">foundation → advanced → professional</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1150" data-end="1153">
<h1 data-start="1155" data-end="1202">👍 Shall we continue with AYUSH Sections now?</h1>
<p data-start="1204" data-end="1234">Reply <strong data-start="1210" data-end="1217">YES</strong> and I will give:</p>
<p data-start="1236" data-end="1371" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">✔ <code data-start="1238" data-end="1253">AyushPage.jsx</code><br data-start="1253" data-end="1256">
✔ <code data-start="1258" data-end="1280">SystemPlantsPage.jsx</code><br data-start="1280" data-end="1283">
✔ Navigation updates<br data-start="1303" data-end="1306">
✔ Perfect UI layout<br data-start="1325" data-end="1328">
✔ Integration with modal (3D model + audio)</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7