s light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="106">Perfect, Harshitha! 🌿<br data-start="22" data-end="25">
We will now add the <strong data-start="45" data-end="63">AYUSH Sections</strong> — the most important part of your project.</p>
<p data-start="108" data-end="133">This feature will create:</p>
<h3 data-start="135" data-end="174">⭐ <code data-start="141" data-end="149">/ayush</code> → Main AYUSH Dashboard</h3>
<h3 data-start="175" data-end="245">⭐ <code data-start="181" data-end="198">/ayush/ayurveda</code>, <code data-start="200" data-end="214">/ayush/unani</code>, etc. → Category plant pages</h3>
<h3 data-start="246" data-end="306">⭐ Fully connected with your PlantModal (3D + audio + AR)</h3>
<p data-start="308" data-end="358">Let’s build it <strong data-start="323" data-end="339">step by step</strong>.<br data-start="340" data-end="343">
Follow exactly.</p>
<hr data-start="360" data-end="363">
<h1 data-start="365" data-end="409">✅ <strong data-start="369" data-end="409">STEP 1 — Create AYUSH Dashboard Page</strong></h1>
<p data-start="411" data-end="461">📁 Create file:<br data-start="426" data-end="429">
<code data-start="429" data-end="461">client/src/pages/AyushPage.jsx</code></p>
<p data-start="463" data-end="484">Paste this full code:</p>
