eak-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="123">You <strong data-start="4" data-end="77">must wrap your entire app inside <code data-start="39" data-end="56">&lt;BrowserRouter&gt;</code> and add <code data-start="65" data-end="75">&lt;Routes&gt;</code></strong> — otherwise your AYUSH pages will never open.</p>
<p data-start="125" data-end="250">Right now your App.jsx <strong data-start="148" data-end="171">ONLY shows HomePage</strong> and <strong data-start="176" data-end="200">has no routes at all</strong>, so <code data-start="205" data-end="213">/ayush</code> and <code data-start="218" data-end="235">/ayush/ayurveda</code> will not work.</p>
<p data-start="252" data-end="290">Don’t worry — I will fix it perfectly.</p>
<hr data-start="292" data-end="295">
<h1 data-start="297" data-end="346">✅ <strong data-start="301" data-end="344">✔ Correct App.jsx (FULL ROUTER VERSION)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="347" data-end="388">📌 Replace your entire App.jsx with this:</p>
