<p data-start="2076" data-end="2159">This caused AYUSH to appear <strong data-start="2104" data-end="2143">as a separate line above the navbar</strong>, not inside it.</p>
<hr data-start="2161" data-end="2164">
<h1 data-start="2166" data-end="2184">🎉 After fixing:</h1>
<ul data-start="2186" data-end="2300">
<li data-start="2186" data-end="2228">
<p data-start="2188" data-end="2228">AYUSH link appears <strong data-start="2207" data-end="2228">inside the navbar</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="2229" data-end="2260">
<p data-start="2231" data-end="2260">UI looks clean &amp; professional</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2261" data-end="2300">
<p data-start="2263" data-end="2300">Navigation items are aligned properly</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2302" data-end="2305">
