<h1 data-start="2132" data-end="2167">🧪 <strong data-start="2137" data-end="2167">Double-check these 3 files</strong></h1>
<h2 data-start="2169" data-end="2216">✔️ Your <code data-start="2180" data-end="2190">main.jsx</code> must contain ONE router</h2>
<h2 data-start="2217" data-end="2265">✔️ Your <code data-start="2228" data-end="2237">App.jsx</code> must NOT contain a router</h2>
<h2 data-start="2266" data-end="2323">✔️ Do NOT wrap components in <code data-start="2298" data-end="2315">&lt;BrowserRouter&gt;</code> again</h2>
<hr data-start="2325" data-end="2328">
