051 6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="language-xml">You cannot render a <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Router</span></span></span></span><span>&gt; inside another </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Router</span></span></span><span>&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="300" data-end="303">
<h1 data-start="305" data-end="352">✅ FIX — Remove <code data-start="322" data-end="339">&lt;BrowserRouter&gt;</code> from App.jsx</h1>
<p data-start="354" data-end="386">Here is the <strong data-start="366" data-end="385">correct App.jsx</strong>:</p>
