<p data-start="132" data-end="166">Let me confirm everything clearly:</p>
<hr data-start="168" data-end="171">
<h1 data-start="173" data-end="214">✅ <strong data-start="177" data-end="214">Why Your AyushPage.jsx Is Correct</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="216" data-end="245">✔ Uses <code data-start="227" data-end="233">Link</code> correctly</h3>
