<h1 data-start="1188" data-end="1249">✅ <strong data-start="1192" data-end="1249">3️⃣ Missing width/height (the model viewer collapses)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="1250" data-end="1301">Sometimes Tailwind breaks sizing.<br data-start="1283" data-end="1286">
