<hr data-start="1516" data-end="1519">
<h1 data-start="1521" data-end="1540">🔍 <strong data-start="1526" data-end="1540">Let's Test</strong></h1>
<p data-start="1541" data-end="1572">Open browser DevTools → Console</p>
<p data-start="1574" data-end="1583">Look for:</p>
<p data-start="1585" data-end="1754">❌ <code data-start="1587" data-end="1643">Failed to load resource: the server responded with 404</code><br data-start="1643" data-end="1646">
❌ <code data-start="1648" data-end="1683">model-viewer failed to load model</code><br data-start="1683" data-end="1686">
❌ <code data-start="1688" data-end="1754">Uncaught ... CustomElementRegistry: model-viewer already defined</code></p>
<p data-start="1756" data-end="1829">If you see any of these, send me the screenshot and I will fix instantly.</p>
<hr data-start="1831" data-end="1834">
<h1 data-start="1836" data-end="1865">📌 Quick Solution Checklist</h1>
