The <code data-start="972" data-end="988">&lt;model-viewer&gt;</code> box will show <em data-start="1003" data-end="1022">empty white space</em> like your screenshot.</p>
<hr data-start="1046" data-end="1049">
<h1 data-start="1051" data-end="1114">✅ <strong data-start="1055" data-end="1114">STEP 3 — For now, add sample models so your modal works</strong></h1>
