<hr data-start="1214" data-end="1217">
<h1 data-start="1219" data-end="1276">🎉 After this, your <code data-start="1241" data-end="1257">&lt;model-viewer&gt;</code> will finally show:</h1>
<p data-start="1278" data-end="1341">✔ 3D rotating model<br data-start="1297" data-end="1300">
✔ AR button<br data-start="1311" data-end="1314">
✔ Working camera controls</p>
<p data-start="1343" data-end="1406">Even though it's an astronaut, it <strong data-start="1377" data-end="1405">proves your system works</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="1408" data-end="1457">Later you can replace them with real herbal ones.</p>
<hr data-start="1459" data-end="1462">
<h1 data-start="1464" data-end="1509">🌿 <strong data-start="1469" data-end="1507">Optional: Real Plant Models (Free)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="1510" data-end="1558">You can download real free plant GLB files from:</p>
<h3 data-start="1560" data-end="1585"><strong data-start="1564" data-end="1585">Poly Pizza (Free)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1586" data-end="1607"><a data-start="1586" data-end="1605" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://poly.pizza/">https://poly.pizza/<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><path d="M14.3349 13.3301V6.60645L5.47065 15.4707C5.21095 15.7304 4.78895 15.7304 4.52925 15.4707C4.26955 15.211 4.26955 14.789 4.52925 14.5293L13.3935 5.66504H6.66011C6.29284 5.66504 5.99507 5.36727 5.99507 5C5.99507 4.63273 6.29284 4.33496 6.66011 4.33496H14.9999L15.1337 4.34863C15.4369 4.41057 15.665 4.67857 15.665 5V13.3301C15.6649 13.6973 15.3672 13.9951 14.9999 13.9951C14.6327 13.9951 14.335 13.6973 14.3349 13.3301Z"></path></svg></span></a></p>
<p data-start="1609" data-end="1618">Search:</p>
<ul data-start="1619" data-end="1674">
<li data-start="1619" data-end="1630">
<p data-start="1621" data-end="1630">"plant"</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1631" data-end="1641">
<p data-start="1633" data-end="1641">"herb"</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1642" data-end="1652">
<p data-start="1644" data-end="1652">"leaf"</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1653" data-end="1663">
<p data-start="1655" data-end="1663">"bush"</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1664" data-end="1674">
<p data-start="1666" data-end="1674">"tree"</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1676" data-end="1715">Download → put inside <code data-start="1698" data-end="1715">/public/models/</code></p>
<hr data-start="1717" data-end="1720">
<h1 data-start="1722" data-end="1761">🌱 If you want, I can also prepare:</h1>
<p data-start="1762" data-end="1801">✅ A full downloadable ZIP containing:</p>
<ul data-start="1802" data-end="1891">
<li data-start="1802" data-end="1815">
<p data-start="1804" data-end="1815">tulsi.glb</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1816" data-end="1828">
<p data-start="1818" data-end="1828">mint.glb</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1829" data-end="1841">
<p data-start="1831" data-end="1841">aloe.glb</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1842" data-end="1860">
<p data-start="1844" data-end="1860">lemongrass.glb</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1861" data-end="1873">
<p data-start="1863" data-end="1873">neem.glb</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1874" data-end="1891">
<p data-start="1876" data-end="1891">usdz versions</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1893" data-end="1971">Just say:<br data-start="1902" data-end="1905">
<strong data-start="1905" data-end="1935">“Give ZIP file for models”</strong><br data-start="1935" data-end="1938">
and I will generate them for you.</p>
