</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">dir</span></span><span> public\audio
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2730" data-end="2826">You should see files like <code data-start="2756" data-end="2767">tulsi.glb</code>, <code data-start="2769" data-end="2786">ashwagandha.glb</code>, <code data-start="2788" data-end="2804">lemongrass.glb</code>, and <code data-start="2810" data-end="2821">tulsi.mp3</code> etc.</p>
<hr data-start="2828" data-end="2831">
<h1 data-start="2833" data-end="2910">STEP 5 — check index.html for model-viewer script (must be <em data-start="2894" data-end="2904">only one</em> copy)</h1>
