<p data-start="3727" data-end="3795">These are correct because files in <code data-start="3762" data-end="3771">public/</code> are served at root <code data-start="3791" data-end="3794">/</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="3797" data-end="3800">
<h1 data-start="3802" data-end="3831">STEP 7 — restart dev server</h1>
<p data-start="3832" data-end="3899">If you had <code data-start="3843" data-end="3856">npm run dev</code> running, stop it (Ctrl+C) and start fresh:</p>
