npm run dev
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="3958" data-end="4058">Wait for Vite to be ready and open <code data-start="3993" data-end="4016">http://localhost:5173</code> (or whichever port your dev server uses).</p>
<hr data-start="4060" data-end="4063">
<h1 data-start="4065" data-end="4091">STEP 8 — test in browser</h1>
<ol data-start="4092" data-end="4338">
<li data-start="4092" data-end="4124">
<p data-start="4095" data-end="4124">Open your app in the browser.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4125" data-end="4165">
<p data-start="4128" data-end="4165">Click a plant card to open the modal.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4166" data-end="4282">
<p data-start="4169" data-end="4282">Under <strong data-start="4175" data-end="4195">3D Model Preview</strong> you should see the astronaut model rotate. AR icon should appear on supported devices.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4283" data-end="4338">
<p data-start="4286" data-end="4338">If you added audio, the player should show and play.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="4340" data-end="4343">
<h1 data-start="4345" data-end="4386">Troubleshooting (if things still blank)</h1>
<p data-start="4387" data-end="4445">Open DevTools → Console and Network, then reload the page.</p>
<p data-start="4447" data-end="4456">Look for:</p>
<ul data-start="4457" data-end="4739">
<li data-start="4457" data-end="4522">
<p data-start="4459" data-end="4522"><code data-start="4459" data-end="4464">404</code> for <code data-start="4469" data-end="4488">/models/tulsi.glb</code> → file path wrong / file missing.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4523" data-end="4660">
<p data-start="4525" data-end="4660"><code data-start="4525" data-end="4595">CustomElementRegistry: the name 'model-viewer' has already been used</code> → you have 2 model-viewer loads; remove duplicates (see STEP 5).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4661" data-end="4739">
<p data-start="4663" data-end="4739"><code data-start="4663" data-end="4698">model-viewer failed to load model</code> → check network / CORS / file corrupted.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4741" data-end="4860">If you see any error messages, copy the console screenshot or the exact text and paste it here — I’ll tell you the fix.</p>
<hr data-start="4862" data-end="4865">
<h1 data-start="4867" data-end="4911">Want me to prepare a ZIP you can download?</h1>
<p data-start="4912" data-end="5078">I can prepare a ZIP containing the sample <code data-start="4954" data-end="4960">.glb</code> and <code data-start="4965" data-end="4972">.usdz</code> files (and mp3s) with correct names so you can just extract into <code data-start="5038" data-end="5054">client/public/</code>. If you want that, say:</p>
<p data-start="5080" data-end="5120"><strong data-start="5080" data-end="5120">“Please create ZIP of sample models”</strong></p>
<hr data-start="5122" data-end="5125">
<p data-start="5127" data-end="5261" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">When you finish the steps above, tell me <strong data-start="5168" data-end="5178">“done”</strong> and I’ll guide you to enable real plant models later and add the Quiz system next.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.1