ol items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="159">No worries — I’ll give you the <strong data-start="31" data-end="46">exact steps</strong>, <strong data-start="48" data-end="66">where to click</strong>, and <strong data-start="72" data-end="100">where to place the files</strong>.<br data-start="101" data-end="104">
Follow slowly — <strong data-start="120" data-end="153">you will finish Step 3 easily</strong>. 💚</p>
<hr data-start="161" data-end="164">
<h1 data-start="166" data-end="212">✅ <strong data-start="170" data-end="210">STEP 3 — Add 3D Models + Audio Files</strong></h1>
<p data-start="213" data-end="314">Your project UI looks plain because <strong data-start="249" data-end="274">3D model files (.glb)</strong> and <strong data-start="279" data-end="301">audio files (.mp3)</strong> are missing.</p>
<p data-start="316" data-end="412">We will now <strong data-start="328" data-end="353">download sample files</strong> and place them in the correct folders you already created.</p>
<hr data-start="414" data-end="417">
<h1 data-start="419" data-end="469">⭐ <strong data-start="423" data-end="469">STEP 3A — DOWNLOAD SAMPLE 3D MODELS (.glb)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="471" data-end="500">You need 3 sample .glb files.</p>
<h3 data-start="502" data-end="535">✔️ Model 1 — Tulsi (GLB file)</h3>
<ol data-start="536" data-end="792">
<li data-start="536" data-end="625">
<p data-start="539" data-end="625"><strong data-start="539" data-end="559">CLICK this link:</strong><br data-start="559" data-end="562">
<a data-start="565" data-end="623" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://modelviewer.dev/shared-assets/models/Astronaut.glb">https://modelviewer.dev/shared-assets/models/Astronaut.glb<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><path d="M14.3349 13.3301V6.60645L5.47065 15.4707C5.21095 15.7304 4.78895 15.7304 4.52925 15.4707C4.26955 15.211 4.26955 14.789 4.52925 14.5293L13.3935 5.66504H6.66011C6.29284 5.66504 5.99507 5.36727 5.99507 5C5.99507 4.63273 6.29284 4.33496 6.66011 4.33496H14.9999L15.1337 4.34863C15.4369 4.41057 15.665 4.67857 15.665 5V13.3301C15.6649 13.6973 15.3672 13.9951 14.9999 13.9951C14.6327 13.9951 14.335 13.6973 14.3349 13.3301Z"></path></svg></span></a></p>
</li>
<li data-start="626" data-end="672">
<p data-start="629" data-end="672">When it opens → Right-click → <strong data-start="659" data-end="670">Save As</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="673" data-end="714">
