<hr data-start="1243" data-end="1246">
<h1 data-start="1248" data-end="1280">⭐ <strong data-start="1252" data-end="1280">STEP 4C — Test 3D Viewer</strong></h1>
<ol data-start="1281" data-end="1359">
<li data-start="1281" data-end="1298">
<p data-start="1284" data-end="1298">Open the app</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1299" data-end="1340">
<p data-start="1302" data-end="1340">Click any plant (Tulsi, Neem, Mint…)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1341" data-end="1359">
<p data-start="1344" data-end="1359">You should see:</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="1361" data-end="1472">✔ Big modal<br data-start="1372" data-end="1375">
✔ 3D rotating model<br data-start="1394" data-end="1397">
✔ “Open 3D Model” button<br data-start="1421" data-end="1424">
✔ “Launch AR” button<br data-start="1444" data-end="1447">
✔ Audio player (for some)</p>
<hr data-start="1474" data-end="1477">
<h1 data-start="1479" data-end="1508">❓ Before moving to Step 5</h1>
<p data-start="1509" data-end="1517">Tell me:</p>
<h3 data-start="1519" data-end="1566"><strong data-start="1523" data-end="1566">What do you see when you click a plant?</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="1567" data-end="1656">
<li data-start="1567" data-end="1583">
<p data-start="1569" data-end="1583">A black box?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1584" data-end="1603">
<p data-start="1586" data-end="1603">A broken model?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1604" data-end="1627">
<p data-start="1606" data-end="1627">A working 3D model?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1628" data-end="1656">
<p data-start="1630" data-end="1656">Only “3D not available”?</p>
</li>
</ul>
