<p data-start="764" data-end="883">If you want, I will give you <strong data-start="793" data-end="828">the exact real plant GLB models</strong> next.<br data-start="834" data-end="837">
(Just say: <strong data-start="848" data-end="882">“send me real plant glb files”</strong>)</p>
<hr data-start="885" data-end="888">
<h1 data-start="890" data-end="937">✅ <strong data-start="894" data-end="937">2. Why do you get the AR popup message?</strong></h1>
<p data-start="938" data-end="1033">You clicked: <strong data-start="951" data-end="964">Launch AR</strong> →<br data-start="966" data-end="969">
