057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-js"><span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">alert</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"If your device supports AR, tap the AR button on the model viewer."</span></span><span>);
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1123" data-end="1270">So this alert is <strong data-start="1140" data-end="1150">normal</strong> and expected.<br data-start="1164" data-end="1167">
It <strong data-start="1170" data-end="1201">does NOT launch AR directly</strong> — because only Android and iPhone devices can open AR (not laptops).</p>
<p data-start="1272" data-end="1302">🔹 <strong data-start="1275" data-end="1300">AR will work only on:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1303" data-end="1365">
<li data-start="1303" data-end="1329">
<p data-start="1305" data-end="1329">Android (scene-viewer)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1330" data-end="1365">
<p data-start="1332" data-end="1365">iPhone/iPad (QuickLook <code data-start="1355" data-end="1362">.usdz</code>)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1367" data-end="1396">🔹 <strong data-start="1370" data-end="1394">AR will NOT work on:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1397" data-end="1436">
<li data-start="1397" data-end="1415">
<p data-start="1399" data-end="1415">Windows laptop</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1416" data-end="1436">
<p data-start="1418" data-end="1436">Desktop computer</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1438" data-end="1481">That is why you only see the popup message.</p>
