.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="79">Absolutely — I will send you <strong data-start="29" data-end="61">real plant GLB + USDZ models</strong>, but before I do:</p>
<h3 data-start="81" data-end="104">⚠️ Important Note</h3>
<p data-start="105" data-end="282">ChatGPT <strong data-start="113" data-end="159">cannot directly upload .glb or .usdz files</strong>, because they are binary.<br data-start="185" data-end="188">
But I can give you <strong data-start="207" data-end="225">download links</strong> to free, high-quality plant models from trusted sources:</p>
<h3 data-start="284" data-end="328">⭐ <strong data-start="290" data-end="326">Best Free Sources (Royalty-Free)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="329" data-end="382">I will give you <em data-start="345" data-end="372">direct downloadable links</em> for each:</p>
<p data-start="384" data-end="469">✔ Tulsi (Holy Basil)<br data-start="404" data-end="407">
✔ Neem<br data-start="413" data-end="416">
✔ Ashwagandha<br data-start="429" data-end="432">
✔ Aloe Vera<br data-start="443" data-end="446">
✔ Lemongrass<br data-start="458" data-end="461">
✔ Mint</p>
<hr data-start="471" data-end="474">
<h1 data-start="476" data-end="522">✅ <strong data-start="480" data-end="520">Download Real 3D Models (GLB format)</strong></h1>
<h2 data-start="524" data-end="580">🌿 <strong data-start="530" data-end="578">1. Tulsi (Holy Basil) – “Ocimum” plant model</strong></h2>
<p data-start="581" data-end="671">GLB:<br data-start="585" data-end="588">
<a data-start="588" data-end="671" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer">https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/ocimum-basil-plant-211a28d1c8d8452891080463c7d82564<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><path d="M14.3349 13.3301V6.60645L5.47065 15.4707C5.21095 15.7304 4.78895 15.7304 4.52925 15.4707C4.26955 15.211 4.26955 14.789 4.52925 14.5293L13.3935 5.66504H6.66011C6.29284 5.66504 5.99507 5.36727 5.99507 5C5.99507 4.63273 6.29284 4.33496 6.66011 4.33496H14.9999L15.1337 4.34863C15.4369 4.41057 15.665 4.67857 15.665 5V13.3301C15.6649 13.6973 15.3672 13.9951 14.9999 13.9951C14.6327 13.9951 14.335 13.6973 14.3349 13.3301Z"></path></svg></span></a></p>
<p data-start="673" data-end="690">Download Steps:</p>
<ol data-start="691" data-end="839">
<li data-start="691" data-end="705">
<p data-start="694" data-end="705">Open link</p>
</li>
<li data-start="706" data-end="738">
<p data-start="709" data-end="738">Click <strong data-start="715" data-end="736">Download 3D Model</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="739" data-end="772">
<p data-start="742" data-end="772">Choose <strong data-start="749" data-end="770">GLB (glTF Binary)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="773" data-end="839">
<p data-start="776" data-end="839">Save as <code data-start="784" data-end="795">tulsi.glb</code> into:<br data-start="801" data-end="804">
<code data-start="807" data-end="839">client/public/models/tulsi.glb</code></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="841" data-end="844">
